Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大家空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大家能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好像已经启动了…看似是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这让人有点不安呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,总之各种bug乱飞…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,各位，再次问候，空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「不稳定吗？」那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是启动了…看似是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.65,0:02:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛，能不能行还真不好说…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能行吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个开成ON了，好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,ON了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,目前看起来还挺好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯现在好像能动了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过刚才还…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有点奇怪呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉玩恐怖游戏的时候就会出点bug是怎么回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,「卡的动不了了？」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说卡不如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好像行为不太对劲…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「是灵障」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛，能动就行了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「什么症状呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,显示器，我现在在用两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢以前好像也…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是玩完JSP之后吗？那之后也…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,显示器的电源…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,脱落了什么的，确实有这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛，这种事情也会有的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今天那个…在玩这个之前啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,烘干机自己就开了，那个是不是也有什么关系呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是但是，这种事情也是会有的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,直播模式ON了，没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得乱搞的话可能会出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,返回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,设置变更…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,应用之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,比较好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题…？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,能行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,切成日语了，直播模式ON了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像能行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好，既然能行就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,各位，实在让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再次正式问候，大家空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的声音和雪吹的声音，大概能听到一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺大的吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊抱歉，解除画面固定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不过这样，稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有点怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「游戏声音没了」抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「能听到哦～」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「与其说稍微不如说雪吹的真厉害呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,OK，请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,再降低一点比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最坏的情况的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真的不行的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会换别的游戏玩…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要成功啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,上了～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,1、2，从头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，要动起来啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然声音还…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜喂！凯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜没看天气预报吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全语音？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜这种天这还能叫登山吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜所以我才讨厌三个人一起登山啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,非常的…开场就内讧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜大家来不了的时候就不该来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哈？一切都是我的错吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是凯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜就算大家都来不了也要去爬的不是敏君吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜你们两个都这种时候了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪就先走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜前面应该有小屋的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是深雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:07:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜我和凯把话扯清楚就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶！但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜别管了！马上就追上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你先走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这么大风雪还要我先走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是深雪桑啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，现在，声音怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能孤零零一个了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是这边吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,先确认一下音量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,再开始吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「声音没问题」「感觉OK」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「OKOK」「雪也太大」是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，把人丢在这里更可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「语音刚好合适」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，真的？那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好，就这样继续
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,虽想开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,开场就一团糟…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是3个人一起来的，但是吵架了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在变成一个人了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候啊，真的那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人行动的话，我觉得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害，四面八方都是雪…雪山？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，真的会变成这样吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没怎么去过雪山之类的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,下雪会变成这种感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个正常来说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要是视野里只剩一片白就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过好像能看到小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谁谁谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜快点去那个小屋避难吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:53.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜敏君呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君呢，诶？敏君呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜…敏……啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，你是不是ga
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那家伙迟早也会来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜先避难吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊（察觉）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而且好像还拖着脚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…等等啊喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对干了吧，「敏……他」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君——
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哇回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？稍、稍、稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君，不会被埋…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,…了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,算、算了，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君，去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也不得不走了，雪下的太厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在是夏天，完全是反季节
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,下着雪感觉稍微凉快一点呢餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:09:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,餐厅兼住宿的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，这状态不是很糟糕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还能用？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,木头、废品
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跑、下蹲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,餐券…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,像废墟一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,钉子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，凯桑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜电灯用不了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜看看还有什么别的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,电灯想必是用不了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君……血
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君血？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哇，脚好像受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜难怪总觉得腿很重…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然想着好像被拖住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是敏君…把凯君…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,钝器或者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,用刀之类的东西刺了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，生气的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君把敏君…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不知道啊。毕竟他说之后会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜需要什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,需要什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜这个温度两个人都会冻死的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜所以有必要取火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜因为外面长着树，能一边铲雪一边把柴火砍下来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,斧子～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这种时候，被雪埋着的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,木头能烧吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,能用来生火吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,雪毕竟含有水分或者说就是水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢，这种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去铲雪……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下这就是斧子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好……「用斧子破坏」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊，获得武器了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但又稍等一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好大啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很大…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有睡袋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人份的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个又会吵架吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,餐具回收处……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,铁锹或者什么在外面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,先出去看看吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有了有了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拿…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,切换道具…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把这附近？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,铲雪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:13:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近还能铲吗？已经不行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉会有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,木头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这个啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君来的那个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,雪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,去铲掉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不过现在的话还…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赶得上？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,…然后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好……OK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话姑且…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,木头已经够了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「背包没有空间」意外的完全带不上东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「有什么也太吓人」对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「生篝火」…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面生没关系吗？不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个下面，地板不是木头的吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,…不会烧起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，能生起火来真好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「今天也是慢生活吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「今天看上去也会是慢生活」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还有厕所呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是厕所吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像能用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,总归是比有好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜生火了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜这样可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜嗯。还有，睡在这种地板上果然还是太硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜要是有睡袋什么的就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,正好有一个睡袋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过只有一个啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不是这边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，应该说轮流交换睡就可
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，有2个啊抱歉，我以为只有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,正好有2个哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，敏君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是两人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,铺睡袋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过监视火的情况的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是必要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,腿上的伤看上去还挺重的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,出了很多血呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜总之这样可以了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜嗯，也算是什么灾难都见过了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜毕竟山上的天气和少女心都是善变的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜像这样的事也是会有的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事也是有的呢，少女心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜总之先休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜也许雪到时候就停了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜要是敏在我们休息的时候能过来就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么沉默啊，说敏君的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是干掉了吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是说敏君没来的意思吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「语音可以再大一点吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,语音，可能有点小
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再、再调大一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,角色语音…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,确实感觉稍微有点小
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过只有…语音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能调我也不太确定，试试看吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,语音可以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是1所以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把整体音量……降低
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把整体音量调低…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只把语音…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微调高的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在整体调低的基础上…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,BGM音量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过BGM大概已经关了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，再把整体调到这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这样差不多了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，先…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，现在稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,会闪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,画面…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,先返回
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,应用…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，可以存档了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,第1天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以保存啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜这个工作台…好像能用！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜只要有材料的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样，刚才语音大了一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果再大一点更合适的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,整体再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,调低，语音，调高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「变得容易听到了」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「感觉不错」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服的感觉的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「听这有点小」还小吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「调高了哦～」「感觉不错」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「善」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「制作物品」「挖雪的量增加」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「耐力：耐力增加」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「槽数：背包的容量增加」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～可以升级啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有废品的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有种慢生活的感觉，但不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,废品，捡起来，原来是这个啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,…捡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,护身符？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,玉姬酱…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.32,0:19:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是玉姬君啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,开运
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，怎么返回啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,空格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是Chilla's桑的赞助商的感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,各种人都会出现的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊这个，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人生游戏那种感觉的游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么焦成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,各种地方都有护身符呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人生游戏那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「转扭蛋」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「一硬币 必中！」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西真的，会中吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,转……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…没有硬币不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,难道发生过火灾吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，说是烧过的话又不像…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这里烧过的话总觉得有点违和感…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事…？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「白天」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这个叫…发烟什么东西的来着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,废品也，没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒一样的东西有3个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再加到，5个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.41,0:21:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,说是广播塔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,「巴士」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「澡堂」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「隧道」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「帕青哥」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小镇……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「家庭餐厅」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「洞窟」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,相当的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,像是会有人迹的小镇，但却
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,杳无人烟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「书店」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「老宅」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,…地图吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这个不能带走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,广播塔好像有点像东京塔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是东京塔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「还挺繁荣的呢」是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉还挺繁荣的才对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,捡起来吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来收集吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,护身符，不过护身符越多的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就越能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.13,0:22:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,投入薪火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好像该投一些
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,脚的情况怎么样呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能对话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,多弄点也无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.07,0:22:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,第二次存档…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「首先得暖暖身体」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.79,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,先休息一下吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.73,0:23:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊，一天之内积了相当多呢，大概
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.43,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,下面的槽是那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……是体力的感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,雪也积太多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.55,0:23:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哇，还在下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.03,0:23:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜什么时候才会停啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.74,0:23:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜雪积的实在是太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:25.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜从刚才就一直在给敏打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜但是一直打不通
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,电话还能通啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:30.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜最好放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜这里已经收不到信号了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜一般都会察觉到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜……山白桑！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜收音机在播什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.07,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,收音机？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.41,0:23:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}收音机｜…村里正在持续下着反季节的雪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}收音机｜据气象台反馈，这场雪的停止时间尚不明确
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,反季节？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}收音机｜根据积雪情况，道路状况和视野可能会恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.31,0:24:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}收音机｜请居民们避免不必要的外出，在室内确保安全
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}收音机｜重复一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.35,0:24:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，现在什么季节？夏天？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.75,0:24:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜刚才试了一下，这里收不到信号，好像没法求救
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.07,0:24:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.98,0:24:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜去二楼能看到的广播塔的话，也许能求救…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.21,0:24:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,果然必须去那里啊，广播塔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.13,0:24:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我的脚已经这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜因为这场雪，还得一边铲雪一边走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.75,0:24:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，只能我去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:37.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我去广播塔求救
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜都怪我没用，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.74,0:24:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我也会在这里帮山白桑的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜那么…我走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.35,0:24:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那，我走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜对了，把这个收音机带上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.21,0:24:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,收音机？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜另外
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.75,0:24:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜有什么想问的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君他，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.94,0:25:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「- 在雪地上走不是更快吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「- 体力没问题吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.91,0:25:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「- 必要的东西放哪里好呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,体力没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不过也没有吃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,必要的东西放哪里呢，这个只能选一个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.19,0:25:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜有个大冷藏箱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜放在入口附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.50,0:25:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我觉得把需要的东西放进去就好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.51,0:25:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOkay
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.18,0:25:33.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑的体力毕竟不是无限的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.63,0:25:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.31,0:25:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜体力没了的话，吃点什么，或者用这个篝火暖暖身体
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,OK…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:41.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜要是火势弱了的话就投柴火
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.36,0:25:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜木头会从冷藏箱消耗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜晚上太冷了体力无法彻底恢复，要好好休息哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好休息不行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.05,0:25:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜直接在雪地上，暴风雪会把人冻僵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:26:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜所以直接在雪地前进是不可行的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，常说在雪地上很危险嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,总之现在是满的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.92,0:26:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,需要能投进火堆里的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,存档存到存的太过头
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.10,0:26:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,冷藏箱是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「铲雪出道」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,…成就
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还挺舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，不过实际上啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.06,0:26:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的是寂静岭出身的，不过寂静岭…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.66,0:26:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，不会下雪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不太明白
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会一天就变成这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雪会变成这样吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.39,0:26:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,经过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.77,0:26:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一天的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.65,0:26:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，虽然说有积雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.39,0:26:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,视野…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没到这么白茫茫的程度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.57,0:27:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的体力完全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.05,0:27:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点做，边休息边来的感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.02,0:27:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上，体力会被大量消耗呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.85,0:27:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,积雪积的及其离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.88,0:27:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「及其惊人的豪雪地域的话」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.33,0:27:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「寂静岭县不会下雪呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.21,0:27:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不会下雪呢～
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎没见过积雪的样子，不过一瞬间飘飘的倒是有…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.01,0:27:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想要无限体力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.94,0:27:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这个，不管怎么铲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.41,0:27:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不明白呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.97,0:27:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里有什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,到广播塔的路应该挺难走的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.00,0:28:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.57,0:28:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,雪很重呢，雪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也没干过铲雪之类的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.39,0:28:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,废品的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.33,0:28:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,能强化的话，会变得相当强强吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.84,0:28:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.57,0:28:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还是得投柴火呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.11,0:28:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,包没空间
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也能放这里吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，放进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.46,0:28:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,废品也放进了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.90,0:28:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊，虽然能放进去很好…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但怎么取出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在线求取出方法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.43,0:29:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,放进去是放进去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.82,0:29:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,废品个别……啊，放进去就行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.10,0:29:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不需要取出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.93,0:29:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无视野
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.29,0:29:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,诶这就没耐力了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.97,0:29:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,让我稍歇
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.07,0:29:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说，柴火
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.55,0:29:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不主动投放也……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.66,0:29:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊有投柴火的按钮，所以还是投下比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,投了吗，啊不过好像变得超暖和了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.65,0:29:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.05,0:29:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君——
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…挖下去的话会出现吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.57,0:30:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「变得超亮了」是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.97,0:30:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,…好，出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,休息的时候狂扔柴火就好了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.07,0:30:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,木头剩3个了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大概到这里……不用挖到底吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一定程度，上面…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.15,0:30:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.03,0:30:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好像微妙地漂浮在空中的雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.31,0:30:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.34,0:30:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊，雪，走在雪上会冷到冻住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.34,0:30:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.22,0:30:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,下到这种程度的话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.30,0:31:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉雪上雪下没什么区别，但其实差别挺大的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.65,0:31:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，废品
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.56,0:31:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不过还挺舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.14,0:31:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,渐渐，一点点的视野开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢打开
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.92,0:31:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,2个废品…3
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.49,0:31:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个能增加耐力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,废品4个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.50,0:31:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.06,0:31:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,物品槽数量也可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.03,0:31:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,先把耐力升高
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.98,0:31:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.90,0:31:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好，先休息一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.18,0:31:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好快好快
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.25,0:31:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不想全都要吗？全都想要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.47,0:31:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也想要树，先把这边的树给
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.48,0:31:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.18,0:32:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「目前还没有Chilla's出品的游戏的感觉呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.32,0:32:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，确实现在比起恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.54,0:32:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,完全是银色世界
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.72,0:32:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,白茫茫一片什么都看不见…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.92,0:32:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,某种意义上…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.31,0:32:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在这片雪中…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人铲雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.91,0:32:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,必须去广播塔这件事，虽然也是恐怖就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.44,0:32:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,雪系恐怖也有点可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不太熟悉…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.89,0:32:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,遇难之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.83,0:32:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,果然豪雪地域的话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.16,0:32:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不注意不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.95,0:32:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再投一点柴火吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.17,0:33:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.86,0:33:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.80,0:33:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然后放入废品…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.61,0:33:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才用过废品了所以还…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.85,0:33:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,留着比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪个方向挖比较好？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.07,0:33:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,人救…叫人来也是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.61,0:33:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这…是村子吧，姑且…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.01,0:33:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.05,0:33:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.94,0:33:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,空罐子？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.75,0:33:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能用来做什么吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.18,0:33:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上，这种时候该怎么办比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.51,0:33:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.59,0:34:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在雪中遇难的处理方法完全不知道，说起来的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉体力还是留着比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.61,0:34:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是雪还是不是雪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.90,0:34:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的登山遇难什么的也…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.11,0:34:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,…不要乱动比较好对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.56,0:34:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「做雪洞」
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.69,0:34:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听说雪洞意外地暖和哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「不老实待着的话体力也存不住」是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.48,0:34:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,食物如果真的有确实的储备的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是另一回事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.17,0:34:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,…铲雪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.25,0:34:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.76,0:34:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人铲雪不太现实
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.61,0:34:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过出入口果然还是确保一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,…感觉是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.21,0:34:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,比起完全……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.88,0:35:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不做的话，还是做一点比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.40,0:35:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,被完全埋住就糟了，大概
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.22,0:35:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.63,0:35:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,回去一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「一个人是不现实」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.35,0:35:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.50,0:35:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「带巧克力{\alpha&H80&}很重要{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.98,0:35:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊好像听说过，巧克力作为紧急食粮非常…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.23,0:35:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,优秀这样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.22,0:35:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现实中的话，根本做不到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.64,0:35:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,太重…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这么轻松地挖开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,挖的时候也还在下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪个方向挖比较好？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.87,0:35:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,先姑且看一眼地图吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.34,0:36:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,…是那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.25,0:36:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在在餐厅吧，这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,名为道路的道路……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.97,0:36:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有点远啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.21,0:36:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明明从窗户看的话感觉挺近的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.92,0:36:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.50,0:36:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，好茄子～
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.96,0:36:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，看着照片走也不知道对不对呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.53,0:36:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「先去近的地方试试？」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.13,0:36:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.69,0:36:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,近的地方的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.48,0:36:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,…洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.48,0:36:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像洞窟的地方和书店比较近吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.57,0:37:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再去视野开阔一点的地方就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,连方向感都快没了…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.46,0:37:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有电线杆的地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有像道路一样的路吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.23,0:37:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始雪少一点的地方，如果有的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.08,0:37:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就很容易认出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.53,0:37:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,罐罐～好像也有废品之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.87,0:37:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,想要更多废品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.05,0:37:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOkay
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.09,0:37:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去村里……与其说村里，哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.65,0:37:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,设施什么的，民宅什么的，能做点什么吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:37:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力、力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.26,0:38:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,成就获得了☆ZE
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.31,0:38:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可能上升了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,挖的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.55,0:38:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着电线杆…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.40,0:38:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.45,0:38:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,废品～
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.86,0:38:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,体力也想要无限的呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.59,0:38:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘力量、耐力
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.03,0:38:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,携带数量，全部都想要啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.63,0:38:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,电线杆什么的没画出来呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从餐厅…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.63,0:39:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～废品
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.86,0:39:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哪边是哪边啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.42,0:39:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想要树的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.53,0:39:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对面…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.11,0:39:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.65,0:39:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,电线杆可以当路标呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.17,0:39:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,已经挖了不少了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.80,0:39:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.90,0:39:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,先投柴火烧着…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.48,0:39:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.31,0:39:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,废品现在4个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.17,0:39:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,背包槽数升一个吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.91,0:39:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要18个了…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.75,0:39:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,之后可能想狂加体力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.78,0:40:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得这边，这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.42,0:40:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,以这个为标记…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,先去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.31,0:40:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,前进哟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.17,0:40:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.23,0:40:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能看到什么，看板？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.44,0:40:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是餐厅的招牌吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.03,0:40:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很好很好，废品很多
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是5个来着吗，下一个体力…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.48,0:40:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也想要挖掘力量
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.29,0:40:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有耐力了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.86,0:40:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:40:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是狼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,狼的声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.09,0:41:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,狼？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,终于让人想起
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.78,0:41:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一部叫做《冰冻（2010）》的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.26,0:41:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,广播塔的话，说直走好像就是直走的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.80,0:41:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，这边好像能看到像村子一样的东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.32,0:41:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,直接去广播塔那边比较好吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.05,0:41:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对在这边，狼…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.00,0:41:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，现在是狼也没法走的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.42,0:41:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,…超降雪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一天好长啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.76,0:41:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果睡觉的话，能睡着吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.69,0:41:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉的时候会积雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.48,0:41:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只能一整天狂挖了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.28,0:42:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能看到什么，也有点觉得是死路
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.86,0:42:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这里能过去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.38,0:42:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,超级暴雪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.84,0:42:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,关于这个声音有什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.57,0:42:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.22,0:42:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近会遇到狼之类的信息没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.88,0:42:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是狼也会冻住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.55,0:42:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.73,0:42:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉再来点树会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.03,0:42:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,废品3，树3…好少
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.01,0:42:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,直走可能比较好吧，这边好像
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.73,0:42:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有招牌但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.19,0:42:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再走也什么都…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.19,0:42:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,果然应该是死路…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.78,0:43:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,该直走吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.88,0:43:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…稍等……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.57,0:43:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这边，开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在挖掘推进之中，感觉已经分不清方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.25,0:43:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也想要树…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.44,0:43:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像是不同方向的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.96,0:43:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,树来多少都不嫌多
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,挖到耐力耗尽的极限吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.11,0:43:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个呢，广播塔…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.23,0:44:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着广播塔走就好了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.41,0:44:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没有耐力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.45,0:44:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该先把耐力升高吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.61,0:44:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.63,0:44:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.71,0:44:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便一问…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.17,0:44:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,亮度…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.07,0:44:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,再亮一点之类的请求，有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.78,0:44:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这样差不多了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.78,0:44:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「天黑了吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.20,0:44:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.86,0:44:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只是单纯的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.01,0:44:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,天黑了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.07,0:44:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可能因为是晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,确实之前更亮呢，这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.57,0:44:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再调亮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.43,0:44:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.21,0:44:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可能因为是晚上，所以暗得很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.29,0:44:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.67,0:44:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.90,0:44:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是没灯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.38,0:45:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,想要灯啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.67,0:45:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,头灯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.21,0:45:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,想戴在头上啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.80,0:45:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「今天还是休息比较好」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？休息的话但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.17,0:45:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,已经挖好的部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.03,0:45:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不会被埋掉吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.28,0:45:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么休息真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.75,0:45:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力能升多少就升多少吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.36,0:45:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,休息
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.67,0:45:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好像只能睡了…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.19,0:45:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我说啊，不想吃热乎的料理吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.09,0:45:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.76,0:45:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃拉面什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.98,0:45:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.43,0:45:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我看到厨房有食材
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.04,0:45:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.59,0:45:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,能吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.01,0:45:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜你是想叫我做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.92,0:46:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.75,0:46:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不是，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.75,0:46:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,做……不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.47,0:46:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜可以哦，我试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.11,0:46:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也只能做了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.88,0:46:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,…黑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.34,0:46:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,胡萝卜…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.48,0:46:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.09,0:46:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呢，确实也算有些东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.19,0:46:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,土豆…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.88,0:46:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么好像……是不是吃过苹果了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.96,0:46:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自的…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.32,0:46:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,用斧子破坏…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.11,0:46:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.81,0:46:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拿了胡萝卜之后除了胡萝卜什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.46,0:46:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咖喱？在这种地方…？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.44,0:46:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.69,0:46:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.09,0:47:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.26,0:47:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就切成这样吗…算了…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.57,0:47:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,放入食材
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.98,0:47:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是说得拿一个食材切一个的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.94,0:47:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这土豆就这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.76,0:47:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，大块大块的蔬菜肯定好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,切得相当大块
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.69,0:47:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,能煮熟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.38,0:47:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,洋葱…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.69,0:47:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在好的地方有好的食材…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.46,0:47:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.80,0:47:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,凯完全没事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.75,0:47:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？肉？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.71,0:47:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,肉递过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.96,0:47:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.03,0:47:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪li…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么肉？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.15,0:47:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我随口一问
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.97,0:47:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.73,0:47:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.98,0:47:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.30,0:48:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.94,0:48:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜这个肉，要用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.35,0:48:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我是什么肉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.79,0:48:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.88,0:48:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜什么肉？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.17,0:48:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.55,0:48:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……？诶？诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.94,0:48:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道……？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.24,0:48:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.65,0:48:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样放…？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.41,0:48:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是豪迈……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.22,0:48:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好像肉变小了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.59,0:48:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然想用斧子破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.74,0:48:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？斧子拿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.48,0:48:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是白天就不行吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.88,0:48:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,按Q键也…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.90,0:48:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.78,0:48:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不行呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.94,0:49:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1170, 960)}{\fs48}{\alpha&H60&}咖喱块
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.94,0:49:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话，只能放Roux了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.24,0:49:02.24,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※ルー（Roux）\N白酱、天鹅绒酱、褐酱制作中皆使用的基础技法\N等量黄油+小麦粉炒制的混合物\N日式海军咖喱也有使用Roux增稠来解决船体摇摆撒出汤汁的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.71,0:49:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了～做好了～
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.26,0:49:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,用不知道是什么肉的谜之肉做的咖喱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.73,0:49:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,递过来不知道是什么的肉，不是很不妙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.13,0:49:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.98,0:49:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜雪山上的咖喱是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想必是最棒的…虽然确实是最棒的……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.36,0:49:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是正常情况下的话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.19,0:49:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,正常情况下的正常的咖喱是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.96,0:49:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是最棒的……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.25,0:49:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.01,0:49:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是、是、是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.48,0:49:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不过，要是有饭就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.25,0:49:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜果然不做咖喱饭就感觉差口气
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.88,0:49:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，倒也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.17,0:49:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑，没有米吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.25,0:49:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没有米吗ww
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.07,0:49:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,反过来问凯桑，你没有吗，明明都……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.82,0:49:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,带了那么多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.56,0:49:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,连区区米都没准备吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.00,0:49:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜嗯，没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.41,0:49:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哦～没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.30,0:50:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.76,0:50:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,虽、虽说没有，但是好像话里有话？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜抱歉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.13,0:50:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜算了，倒也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.57,0:50:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我在道歉…ww
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.78,0:50:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪酱又没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.99,0:50:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜敏没跟上来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.86,0:50:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有，反而做了菜很温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.89,0:50:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.14,0:50:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜喂，凯君
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.42,0:50:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，凯君
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.64,0:50:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么说到敏君的事就沉默了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.94,0:50:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.44,0:50:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你说了sh
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜所以说敏君没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.71,0:50:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜啊啊……嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.82,0:50:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…含糊其辞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.05,0:50:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君你是不是状态有点怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.21,0:50:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.29,0:50:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是……没有问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.59,0:50:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不啊，没那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.28,0:50:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我没问题，什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.73,0:50:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没做这句话一般不会说吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.86,0:50:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一般来说……待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.09,0:50:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后说你先走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.28,0:50:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那个时候完全…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.69,0:50:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好像还很精神的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.84,0:51:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再详细问的话感觉会装傻
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.12,0:51:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,实际是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.61,0:51:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没做…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.08,0:51:06.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜今天就睡了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.73,0:51:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.36,0:51:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪酱危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.01,0:51:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,得逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.05,0:51:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么都没做很奇怪吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.85,0:51:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定是误导，这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.05,0:51:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过确实可疑到做作…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.96,0:51:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会想是不是干掉敏君了…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.51,0:51:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.53,0:51:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.74,0:51:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.33,0:51:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.16,0:51:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.42,0:51:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,完全对上眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.68,0:51:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.34,0:51:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了做夜宵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.98,0:51:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.70,0:52:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了什么会被记恨的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.58,0:52:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什、本来是……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.85,0:52:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么聚会啊说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.92,0:52:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,腿应该已经好了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.18,0:52:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,切成斧头…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.86,0:52:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一两天的话，怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.78,0:52:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有可能能动一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不行吗，没那么简单吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.53,0:52:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不过如果是重伤的话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.42,0:52:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊还好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.44,0:52:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,挖过去的地方完全
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.17,0:52:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.41,0:52:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还好还好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.86,0:52:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,能模糊地看到呢，广播塔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.17,0:53:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.28,0:53:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是感觉…对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.02,0:53:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君太可疑了…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.17,0:53:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,…凯君
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.93,0:53:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不由自主地觉得是他做的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.82,0:53:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，发生了什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.26,0:53:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都不奇怪吧，不如说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.85,0:53:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,被狼什么的干掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.13,0:53:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这种事我说也…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,会害怕吧什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.95,0:53:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，如果是被狼就这么干掉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.90,0:53:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.07,0:53:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,放我出来铲雪吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.49,0:53:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说有点站着说话不嫌腰疼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.64,0:53:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在雪中……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心动物哦什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.17,0:53:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个应该能叫风凉话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,推进得很顺利啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.50,0:53:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.47,0:54:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有半夜的举止有点可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.88,0:54:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.98,0:54:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看起来那样…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.45,0:54:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.85,0:54:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,木头，我好像漏了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.28,0:54:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧，会警告的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.28,0:54:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？好像，能看到…？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.40,0:54:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微偏了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.90,0:54:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.00,0:54:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,挖到哪里了…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.84,0:54:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想直走的…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.36,0:54:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道是不是在直走…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.05,0:54:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.90,0:54:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，音乐变得好不安
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.64,0:54:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.16,0:54:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在刮暴风雪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.90,0:54:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也一如既往…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.40,0:55:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果连续3天暴风雪的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.32,0:55:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,相当…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.57,0:55:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,…不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.57,0:55:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？说起来是不是没存档
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.59,0:55:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,下次…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.82,0:55:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,回去的时候也行吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.11,0:55:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地到晚上之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.94,0:55:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还挺多的呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.53,0:55:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都看不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.88,0:55:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到了雪的可怕，但是其他方面的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.43,0:55:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还感受不到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.61,0:55:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.19,0:55:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且，保存到别的槽位
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.51,0:55:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是第三天，第二天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.19,0:55:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,废品2个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「凯君真爽啊，看上去好暖和」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.09,0:55:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是，帮点忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过但是，腿…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.22,0:55:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,受伤了想动也动不了也没办法吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.34,0:56:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,腿拖着走的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.28,0:56:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去……也不是什么轻伤
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.07,0:56:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然那就没办法，但是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.87,0:56:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.55,0:56:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,做饭什么的也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.78,0:56:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,分工合作也完全可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.09,0:56:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然递出了肉…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.90,0:56:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不知道是什么的肉…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.13,0:56:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,狼什么的也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.71,0:56:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,鹿什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,野生动物的话，应该有的吧，熊什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.80,0:56:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？好像
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.76,0:56:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.48,0:56:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.71,0:56:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士…？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.98,0:56:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是巴士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.81,0:56:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.30,0:57:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没有埋住…再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.55,0:57:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,…巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.76,0:57:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了找到了什么好像
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.42,0:57:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好，等我一下地图地图
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.50,0:57:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.82,0:57:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说，洞窟…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.28,0:57:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,…已经越过了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.19,0:57:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟前面是巴士呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.98,0:57:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.15,0:57:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,挖挖左边试试看…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.38,0:57:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,「直播里也想看，地图w」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.97,0:57:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.87,0:57:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,应该投点柴火吗？还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.03,0:57:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，天色有点暗了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.96,0:58:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉，刚才不是有巴士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.82,0:58:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.69,0:58:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,…像洞窟一样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.40,0:58:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟直走的地方，什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.94,0:58:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,超市、便利店？虽说不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.13,0:58:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉会有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.53,0:58:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.01,0:58:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微偏右，右边有巴士也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.29,0:58:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再往这边，往树的方向挖的话，洞窟…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.01,0:58:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有吧，这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.38,0:58:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也想挖到巴士…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.82,0:58:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不小心挖过头了…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.32,0:58:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也有树呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.27,0:58:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要是多点标记就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.73,0:59:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「没挖到敏吗？没事吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.07,0:59:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这边应该没有吧？再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.51,0:59:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士也变成废品的话就开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.26,0:59:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,能拆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,…巴士能变成废品吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.09,0:59:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,物理上？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.46,0:59:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.67,0:59:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,搞、搞不懂了，我现在在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.15,0:59:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,「话说铲掉的雪放哪里了？」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,确实诶，喂，铲雪要怎么铲？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.80,0:59:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是把雪铲开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.36,0:59:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，铲雪的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.82,0:59:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那些雪放哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.88,0:59:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,放在脚边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.55,0:59:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,「会去扔掉的」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.82,1:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…但屋、屋顶之类的话往下扔就好了吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.50,1:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想的话好辛苦…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.26,1:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.82,1:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才挖过的地方…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.36,1:00:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不，虽然挖了不少但感觉要迷路了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.01,1:00:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.44,1:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.06,1:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不安的BGM倒是响了好几次…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.05,1:00:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那之外…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.48,1:00:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么异变啊，到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:00:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看不到山什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.06,1:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不，是那个吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.28,1:01:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,把巴士挖出来吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.01,1:01:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.75,1:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,废品超多！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.48,1:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎、怎么办好？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.99,1:01:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,捡起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.07,1:01:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,包里没空间了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.25,1:01:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.65,1:01:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且一边挖一边…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微斜着，左边…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.53,1:01:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想在巴士对面稍微挖一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.94,1:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等耐力没了，就走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.13,1:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,挖了不少了…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.57,1:02:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但还……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.90,1:02:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很远哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.65,1:02:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然好像还能再转一圈左右…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.96,1:02:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.09,1:02:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,废品3
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.57,1:02:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还做不了…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.21,1:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先去巴士
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.15,1:02:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不对…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.01,1:02:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想把挖错的路填回去…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.31,1:02:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,…是这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.07,1:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.91,1:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哇废品好多好开心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.07,1:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,包里已经没空间了…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.46,1:03:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,人不会被埋了吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.40,1:03:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.17,1:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊，这个巴士也是，刚才的…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.40,1:03:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,用斧头能破坏哦，这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.35,1:03:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好黑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.61,1:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多到活动极限了吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.86,1:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,话说发烟筒能用吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.76,1:03:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力——
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.73,1:03:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,先耐力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.92,1:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.15,1:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,选力量
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好…还能行
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.69,1:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很暗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.17,1:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,下的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.37,1:04:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,相当大呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.65,1:04:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.50,1:04:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有了有了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.94,1:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,用斧头破坏…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.69,1:04:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.50,1:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，废品
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.70,1:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这边，出不来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.96,1:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来出不来的样子呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.96,1:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？废品
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.94,1:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,已经经过相当漫长的时间了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.53,1:05:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,都变成废墟了…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.48,1:05:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这还是不是到现在仍然有人的小镇呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.77,1:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,废村？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.57,1:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该挖挖周围看看吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.96,1:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，连上了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.85,1:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士的前面是什么来着，地图上看的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.23,1:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.63,1:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士前面好像有车站一样的东西和…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.01,1:05:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.09,1:05:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,往下面走的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.63,1:05:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.44,1:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下面…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…往那边走的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.48,1:05:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.18,1:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,反方向…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.79,1:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因为像山的感觉应该可以吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.64,1:06:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先回去～
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.82,1:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好…我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.87,1:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,废品……5
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.55,1:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,想升力量啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.83,1:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好，先投点柴火
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.89,1:06:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还够吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.76,1:06:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「会想要能照明的道具呢」是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.07,1:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,方向感快要
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.48,1:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.29,1:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个……
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.31,1:07:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是啊，果然发烟筒可以稍微……
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.63,1:07:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一边用一边走可能比较好…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.75,1:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,每条路扔一条可以
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.88,1:07:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好亮好亮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.16,1:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,…吓我一跳，还以为是人脸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.69,1:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……怎么办呢巴士…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.57,1:07:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这边挖的挺多了，也看看这边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.31,1:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,…那边也一定有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.67,1:07:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,树的方向
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.36,1:08:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那边有什么洞窟和…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.51,1:08:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，再前面…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.98,1:08:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道是便利店还是什么，设施一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.48,1:08:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上有画呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.42,1:08:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「像叫声一样的是什么呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.65,1:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.15,1:08:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是狼或者什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.78,1:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.64,1:08:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了也麻烦，狼什么的…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.53,1:08:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,能战斗的道具…虽然有铁锹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.93,1:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,用那个，能勉强应战吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.57,1:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，前方…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.60,1:08:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,开心…不过有点浪费了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.10,1:08:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果是FS游的狗的话就糟了」
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.97,1:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那可糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.61,1:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,FS狗只要一只就已经
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.13,1:09:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是那边呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.30,1:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,变得更暗了…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.18,1:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是往左边走太多了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.68,1:09:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因为想烧火，所以先
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.60,1:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,想要木头呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.60,1:09:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,以为意外地近，结果不是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.14,1:09:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,…不过
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.67,1:09:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果狼在这边的话……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.32,1:09:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也有点想看一眼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.03,1:10:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有野生动物的踪迹但没有人的踪迹…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.09,1:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有人的踪迹反而更可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.81,1:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,缝隙…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.01,1:10:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像贼风的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.36,1:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.23,1:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那个……不是那个吗，地图上看到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.14,1:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.13,1:10:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道是老宅还是便利店还是超市…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.85,1:10:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.56,1:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.19,1:10:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还能行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.45,1:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,…这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.42,1:11:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.61,1:11:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.25,1:11:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,像是人造物呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.91,1:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.91,1:11:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不……不知道，墙？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.82,1:11:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有点看不懂呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.39,1:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.61,1:12:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不，果然还是有点像房子…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.50,1:12:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,像建筑物呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.49,1:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.30,1:12:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力没了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.57,1:12:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.61,1:12:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.07,1:12:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,活动极限了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.63,1:12:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.55,1:12:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.23,1:12:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很好…废品6个…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.15,1:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,柴火也还有很多
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.20,1:12:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.97,1:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好，开挖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.30,1:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.62,1:13:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.47,1:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是像便利店一样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.21,1:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很高兴…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.88,1:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是至少不像是有人住的样子…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.03,1:13:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊，窗户？有点大吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.21,1:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是窗户吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.22,1:13:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看像窗户…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.73,1:13:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.59,1:14:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…好像
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.59,1:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有听到奇怪的声音…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.83,1:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道这是风声还是……
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.18,1:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西的叫声…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.67,1:14:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到了晚上的瞬间…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.78,1:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,先保存一下吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.97,1:14:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要覆盖吗？OK
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.77,1:14:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，覆盖掉了，明明选了其他槽位
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.35,1:14:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.01,1:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就休息吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.48,1:14:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑，看这个！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.84,1:14:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜找到扑克了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里…？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.05,1:14:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜是嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.55,1:14:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜来打扑克转换心情吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.11,1:14:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.04,1:14:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜抽鬼牌可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.60,1:14:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛……不过深雪酱已经累了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.59,1:14:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜啊……嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.67,1:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，还是需要一点娱乐的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.37,1:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说有一副扑克牌还挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.90,1:15:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的扑克牌…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.68,1:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊「抽走」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.94,1:15:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.43,1:15:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要玩啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.97,1:15:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是抽鬼牌所以没有鬼牌的话，就是对方有鬼牌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.63,1:15:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…选哪个好呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.23,1:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是鬼牌？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.80,1:15:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是鬼牌
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.14,1:15:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是鬼牌
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.15,1:15:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,完全过于扑克脸看不出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.18,1:15:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.88,1:15:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.75,1:15:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.61,1:15:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抽到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.05,1:15:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了，求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.96,1:15:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可是，绝对该洗下手牌的…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.63,1:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,右右右右求求拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.93,1:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好好，拿走咯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.59,1:15:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,…怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.89,1:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,三分之一不要抽到不要抽到绝对不要抽到…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.15,1:15:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,左边
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.81,1:15:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶，赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.02,1:16:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好我赢了我赢咯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.02,1:16:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我赢了～
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.64,1:16:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑，你抽鬼牌很厉害的话一开始就说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.91,1:16:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那样的话我明明一开始就能认真的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.22,1:16:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.51,1:16:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始就能认真就是说一开始没认真？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.91,1:16:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜别嘴硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.97,1:16:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此就再来呗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.17,1:16:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜来玩惩罚游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.84,1:16:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不玩惩罚游戏也无所谓啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.61,1:16:23.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜是呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.28,1:16:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜要我告诉你喜欢的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.31,1:16:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜这种事无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.96,1:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不过你想说的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.68,1:16:31.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜被山白桑看穿了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.67,1:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜喂，那个话题已经够了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.60,1:16:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜挖雪的时候听到声音了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.41,1:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,果然那个声音是那样吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.57,1:16:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜声音？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.73,1:16:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜狼什么的？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.21,1:16:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜附近有野生动物的意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.39,1:16:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不，虽然这么说也对，但感觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.29,1:16:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不知道…好像有听到狼的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.13,1:16:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,像风声的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.25,1:16:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜但还有与之不同的什么东西……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.19,1:16:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.86,1:17:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜因为很危险，所以今晚打算放哨
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.18,1:17:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那样的话我来放哨
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.27,1:17:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑在铲雪所以累了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.93,1:17:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜晚上就好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.49,1:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.32,1:17:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.14,1:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「- 不能交给凯」w
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.26,1:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,总之交给他试试…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.15,1:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.35,1:17:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不行的话我来做
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.75,1:17:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜说的也是呢，那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.45,1:17:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……就拜托你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.86,1:17:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜有我真好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.57,1:17:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜很可靠吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.86,1:17:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜啊……嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.88,1:17:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.88,1:17:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.95,1:17:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然谢谢，但是这种话还是别自己说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.61,1:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不太适合自己说哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.86,1:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.81,1:17:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,总之没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.40,1:17:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，我好像晚上没有醒来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.52,1:17:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你放哨好了吗，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不困吗？没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.13,1:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好，首先等一下…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.19,1:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,保存名为今天的第三天
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.63,1:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.99,1:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能稍等一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.90,1:18:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻，请稍稍等待马上回来～
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.56,1:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.60,1:19:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.38,1:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么……奇怪的事发生吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.78,1:20:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.75,1:20:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.11,1:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在6个…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好，想要新的废品
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.80,1:20:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，按键2像罐头一样的东西会把体力……那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.08,1:20:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,会恢复吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.23,1:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来，挖吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.72,1:20:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近也稍微点起来…？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.68,1:20:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,变得稍微亮一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.27,1:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有像门一样的东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.04,1:20:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,停一下哦，那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.71,1:20:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.97,1:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是什么呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.70,1:20:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是餐厅吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.72,1:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那旁边好像有街机厅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.75,1:21:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,往斜右方走的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.17,1:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,斜右方是街机厅
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.39,1:21:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过从刚才挖的地方连过去可能更近
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.88,1:21:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士那边……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.19,1:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.42,1:21:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士那边有点远…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.74,1:21:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从这边连起来好像不错
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.63,1:21:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「是街机厅吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.28,1:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.02,1:21:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「街机厅必须去啊」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.49,1:21:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，想去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.84,1:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,从这个现在挖的这个大概是建筑的东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.47,1:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微往这边…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.39,1:21:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,继续挖的话，应该有
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.44,1:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.39,1:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,进不去吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.86,1:22:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是想彻底挖开呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.14,1:22:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,相当…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.23,1:22:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是很大的建筑吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.24,1:22:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,…想要废品
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.19,1:22:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘力量或耐力，想升其中一个
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.18,1:22:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～试试吃罐头也可以呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.72,1:22:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，为了以防万一先留着，之后只试一次…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.34,1:22:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…留着3个
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.86,1:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒……这个应该叫发烟筒吗？也没有烟出来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.56,1:22:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.88,1:22:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上会出现什么吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.32,1:23:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为太专注于铲雪…更应该说现在只能铲雪…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.13,1:23:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以容易忘记一件事…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.68,1:23:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这姑且是恐怖游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或者说它就是
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chilla's桑的游戏还挺可怕的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.18,1:23:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在直播缩略图上也有…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.27,1:23:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有那种好像会出来的感觉不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.21,1:23:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还是得做好觉悟……晚上的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.48,1:23:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「说起来是那样」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.57,1:23:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对，现在在铲雪…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.37,1:23:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是铲雪模拟器
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.47,1:23:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是Chilla's桑的新作，是恐怖游戏，所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.42,1:23:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么，什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.78,1:23:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,…会吓到人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.97,1:23:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的要素是有的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.56,1:23:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，入口搞错了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.22,1:23:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边挖挖看？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.30,1:23:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？竟有进不去这种事？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.72,1:23:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许进不去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.25,1:23:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不，不需要全部挖开吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.63,1:24:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，看不到里面呢，好暗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.61,1:24:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.78,1:24:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复的…不怎么多…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.85,1:24:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说从这里…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.09,1:24:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦，地图地图地图
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.67,1:24:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,地图
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.46,1:24:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.01,1:24:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,斜过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.92,1:24:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,挖下去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.47,1:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,「再怎么说也应该有个出入口」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.71,1:24:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的…？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.72,1:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.64,1:24:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.47,1:24:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「只是个物体{\alpha&H80&}吗……{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.10,1:24:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看不透里面的原因…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.23,1:24:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.59,1:24:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微打开看看？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.89,1:25:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,罐头几乎不恢复
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.71,1:25:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,果然寒冷的时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.85,1:25:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不取暖不行呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.01,1:25:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且那边完全没有掉废品
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.21,1:25:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「都挖到这种程度了，没有也太悲伤」
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.85,1:25:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.88,1:25:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.56,1:25:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,附近还有其他建筑…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.40,1:25:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,…老宅，街机厅前面是老宅吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.23,1:25:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,另一边也稍微挖开看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.14,1:25:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾什么的也不掉啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.86,1:26:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有就是说……
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.09,1:26:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，等等好像…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.98,1:26:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.51,1:26:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.80,1:26:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.46,1:26:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,果然应该有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.14,1:26:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没有没意义的建筑
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.31,1:26:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.85,1:26:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是入口吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.95,1:26:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,话说如果有人住过的话
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.98,1:26:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就有点那个呢，这么…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.05,1:26:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,四面八方被雪埋住的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.54,1:26:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,罐头吃掉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.00,1:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为出不来…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.80,1:27:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很不妙吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.97,1:27:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.42,1:27:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么完全遇不到废品啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.02,1:27:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「到不了吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.18,1:27:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得要再往前一点
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.28,1:27:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,想作为露营地的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.35,1:27:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能做成露营地就好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.76,1:27:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,像途中的休息站一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.57,1:27:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.27,1:27:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳稍微开始下山了…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.89,1:27:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近也很暗呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.17,1:28:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,下面的雪又硬又重…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.35,1:28:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得超壮吧…深雪酱我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.96,1:28:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,叫深{\alpha&H80}/美{\alpha&H00&}雪什么的，让人想起金田一呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.88,1:28:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,…那边，还要更往前吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.87,1:28:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,要到天花板了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.30,1:28:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「懂你意思」懂的？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.87,1:28:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…？好像
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.89,1:28:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.03,1:29:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雪已经被铲了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.26,1:29:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.47,1:29:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再休息一次的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.89,1:29:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,应该能挖通
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.96,1:29:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有人的行踪了，也许在…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.56,1:29:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.38,1:29:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,幸存者…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.09,1:29:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在生活吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.68,1:29:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「野生的敏？」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.31,1:29:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是敏君的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.14,1:29:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.55,1:29:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,希望很渺茫吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.52,1:29:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不确定呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.53,1:29:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君——
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.32,1:30:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.48,1:30:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,门…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.97,1:30:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有点开着那就意味着，我会有所误会哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.46,1:30:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我进去了…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.85,1:30:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.73,1:30:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜来的路上有这种地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.15,1:30:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,…好暗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.75,1:30:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.53,1:30:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,说来的时候有这种地方吗，之前有经过这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.02,1:30:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有很危险的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.18,1:30:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗狗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.44,1:30:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是狼的家吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.71,1:30:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是狼的家…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.34,1:30:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,先丢一根吧像这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.28,1:30:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有小狗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.84,1:30:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「找钥匙」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.85,1:31:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,两个……
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.75,1:31:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有小狗的话怎么办好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.31,1:31:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有斧头所以没问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.73,1:31:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很近呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.93,1:31:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没法照的很亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.31,1:31:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.44,1:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，是废品啊好诶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.73,1:31:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.56,1:31:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，能扭蛋…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.28,1:31:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里呢扭蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.05,1:31:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.74,1:33:01.74,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.74,1:33:01.74,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}〇村 集会记录\N\N…8月5日\N…村 集会地\N…家 幼子死亡事件\N…长、五户长、各家代表、…家主、〇\N家妻\N\N本日因〇家之幼子死亡一事召开村集会\N\N因〇家妻之要求，对幼子之死提出异议\N\N〇家妻之陈述与提交材料不同，表示幼\N子之死并非仅因不幸而丧命
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.76,1:31:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,村子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.97,1:31:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么寄宿…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.21,1:31:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是寄宿呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.93,1:32:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,记录…8月5日村集会场…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.60,1:32:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,…家，幼子死亡事件
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.68,1:32:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…长
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.21,1:32:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,〇、〇长…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.13,1:32:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,…五户长？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.14,1:32:14.86,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※名主、組頭、百姓代，江户时代的村方三役\N組頭辅佐名主工作，并常兼任五户一组的五人组的组长\N在此处选择将組頭翻译为五户长
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.28,1:32:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,各…家
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,代表…家代表
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.43,1:32:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,…代表
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.26,1:32:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,…当主
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.91,1:32:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,今日因〇家幼子之死召开……
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.63,1:32:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,JI会？召开
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.56,1:32:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,叫这个对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.39,1:32:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,集会吗？召开集会
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.72,1:32:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因〇家妻之要求，对幼子之死提出异议
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.39,1:32:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,〇家妻…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.22,1:32:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,〇妻之陈述与提交材料不同
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.11,1:33:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,表示幼子之死并非仅因不幸而XXX
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.27,1:34:09.27,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.28,1:34:09.28,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}另外，〇妻在席上对丈夫用…指\N「不是掉下去的」\N「都是那个人的错」\N「平常的事变成无法挽回的局面」\N重复着如上所述的话不等。\N\N对此，出席者提出〇妻之行为不可饶恕\N另，外扬家丑至村外，扰乱村庄之和。\N\N协商的结果，幼子之死保留申报现状，\N作为不幸的事故\N严禁〇妻此后对此事件指责丈夫、向\N村外申诉、离开〇村。\N\N此外，如果〇妻继续做出违背村庄教义\N的言行，全村将考虑给予相应的处分。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.41,1:33:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,另外〇妻在席上
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.64,1:33:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,指着…丈夫…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.67,1:33:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,……指
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.76,1:33:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是掉下去的，都是那个人的错
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.54,1:33:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,平常的事变成无法挽回的局面，这样反复的说
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.93,1:33:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对此，〇妻的行为不可饶恕
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.60,1:33:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,出席者提出这样的意见，而且将家中的不幸…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.56,1:33:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,传播到村外，被视作扰乱村庄之和
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.52,1:33:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,协商的结果，幼子之死保留申报现状
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.91,1:33:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,作为不幸的事故
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.43,1:33:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对〇妻此后因事件指责丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.55,1:33:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,向村外申诉
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.06,1:33:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,离开〇村
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.98,1:33:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,以上行为严格禁止
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.09,1:33:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,离开村子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.53,1:33:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,此外，如果〇妻
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.13,1:34:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,继续做出违背村庄教义的言行
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.60,1:34:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,全村将考虑给予相应的处分
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.72,1:34:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,村子果然很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.84,1:34:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性3｜昨天，我家的人被叫去开会了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.47,1:34:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性3｜你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.85,1:34:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性4｜啊，我家的人也去了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.67,1:34:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性4｜关于之前的事故，她说有话想说…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.31,1:34:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性3｜那个事故到头来…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.17,1:34:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性4｜大概就是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.28,1:34:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性4｜虽然很可怜，但我们不能再多说什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.07,1:34:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是从收音机里放出来的吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.76,1:34:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个村子本身就很糟糕吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.85,1:34:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,丢一根
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.59,1:34:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西在内部用掉太多…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.31,1:35:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也有点可惜的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.06,1:35:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，这个声音的感觉绝对是小狗…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.77,1:35:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…红钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.98,1:35:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.12,1:35:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.61,1:35:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,…有小狗呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.07,1:35:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,…有小汪汪呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.47,1:35:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有点被吃掉了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.14,1:35:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,…小狗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.02,1:35:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不能对小狗做点什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.39,1:35:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别生气别生气
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.60,1:35:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.11,1:35:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好好…我…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.23,1:35:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,乖狗狗乖狗狗呢……
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.77,1:35:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.73,1:36:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才从后面被干掉了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.73,1:36:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等感觉有点危险
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.56,1:36:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？掉下去了…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.43,1:36:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先拿了一把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.69,1:36:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然拿到是拿到了……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.02,1:36:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗狗在哪里……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.16,1:36:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在这在这……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.38,1:36:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.07,1:36:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去反方向的话……好，黄色的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.11,1:36:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,…拿到了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.52,1:36:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉要迎面了小狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.69,1:36:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在那在那
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.32,1:37:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能开了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.69,1:37:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.42,1:37:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大量的废品，50个？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.73,1:37:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大概这里就这些东西吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.54,1:37:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西，稍微回收一下…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.38,1:37:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还想在外面用
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.64,1:37:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,*胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.66,1:37:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,…别生气哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.69,1:37:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了知道了，我先出去一下嘛…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.77,1:37:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.98,1:37:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什么狗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.76,1:37:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…来拿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.65,1:37:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…想
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不知道叫什么名字先叫它发烟筒
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.96,1:37:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒丢在这太可惜了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.46,1:37:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是想要…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.31,1:37:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来抢你的地盘…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.89,1:38:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,才来这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.92,1:38:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.05,1:38:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.67,1:38:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,算了这样也有14个了…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.17,1:38:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好，回去了～
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.25,1:38:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.46,1:38:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,往刚才想挖的地方…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.36,1:38:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以地图来说的话大概这边？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.75,1:38:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,完全看不到…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.84,1:38:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,反而说，明明刮着雪也不觉得冷挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.68,1:38:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,像雪窟那样
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.69,1:38:37.69,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※カマクラ和Igloo\Nカマクラ是堆出雪丘再挖洞\NIgloo因纽特雪屋是砌雪砖搭建
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.30,1:38:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,斜着挖的话，有点勉强吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.61,1:38:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有挖掘力量就能行的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.89,1:38:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上是这边…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.36,1:38:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.78,1:39:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,想往下挖呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.77,1:39:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,…好，先回去一下
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.95,1:39:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.35,1:39:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.39,1:39:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不对不对，也许对…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先强化一下
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.44,1:39:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等变成6个废品了……39个
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.68,1:39:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.64,1:39:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.10,1:39:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.71,1:39:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,试着猛升力量了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.46,1:39:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也想要耐力，但还是优先力量
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.65,1:40:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,果然就是力量，力量就是Power
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.44,1:40:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,…Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.98,1:40:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先保存一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.57,1:40:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,第3天
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.22,1:40:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微变暗了一点，姑且这边…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.02,1:40:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,点亮一下吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.96,1:40:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因为晚上有不安的感觉呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.82,1:40:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果多少有亮光的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.39,1:40:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,能行吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.01,1:40:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.82,1:40:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,相当…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.35,1:40:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,变的顺畅了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.02,1:40:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也不能否认有点冷的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.31,1:40:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉一下子提升了不少，顺畅度
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.14,1:41:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,果然升2格的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.01,1:41:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天差地别…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.39,1:41:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶废品
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.40,1:41:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇现在想全部挖开了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.50,1:41:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要升了力量的话全部…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.30,1:41:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能挖开
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.90,1:41:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,开始感觉到力量果然很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.63,1:41:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.57,1:41:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有废品…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.20,1:41:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「好像会变成肌肉原桑」
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.75,1:41:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,筋肉满满的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.93,1:41:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近也一根
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.96,1:41:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.28,1:42:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,离据点有点远了啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.86,1:42:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,呀…挖掘力量也很重要，不过想到回据点的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.76,1:42:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,果然体力也很重要吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.15,1:42:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.98,1:42:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过说起来…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.90,1:42:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像还有一个呢那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.50,1:42:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,建筑那边
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.36,1:42:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,附近…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.46,1:42:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不是现在挖的地方的那一边…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.40,1:42:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这边…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.23,1:42:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然只是可能…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.86,1:42:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在这附近…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.73,1:42:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.85,1:42:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,像那样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.35,1:42:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上画着…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.80,1:43:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不是便利店的，那个，现在的地方…附近
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.43,1:43:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,试着朝向这颗树前进吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.05,1:43:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,从近的地方，稍微接近看…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.19,1:43:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,废品啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.62,1:43:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个之后再去回收也可以…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.69,1:43:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，明明应该有山的…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.19,1:44:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微偏了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.85,1:44:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.59,1:44:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,…不
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.09,1:44:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.22,1:44:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,便利店…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.18,1:44:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.01,1:44:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.73,1:44:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,位置上
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.46,1:44:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么让大家见证…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.75,1:44:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我想挖到哪里去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.78,1:45:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，地图在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.08,1:45:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有了有了……
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.24,1:45:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.86,1:45:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才挖到的大概就是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.35,1:45:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多废品
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.32,1:45:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那旁边…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.94,1:45:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,像洞窟一样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.07,1:45:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.21,1:45:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.31,1:45:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想挖出来…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.67,1:45:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然向着这个目标前进…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.88,1:45:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不明白啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.22,1:45:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,位置上来说感觉应该是这里……
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.99,1:45:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可能因为稍微歪了点
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.98,1:45:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,难得的机会，能砍多少砍多少
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.60,1:45:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微…这边
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.22,1:46:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…废品
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.32,1:46:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.61,1:46:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.50,1:46:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,先回去吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.64,1:46:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,已经完全变暗了，但还不是晚上吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.46,1:46:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.27,1:46:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,到达了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.60,1:46:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.70,1:46:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,8个还不行啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.69,1:46:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧，赶紧…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.15,1:46:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在变成夜晚之前…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.13,1:46:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.05,1:47:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,…是这里吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.72,1:47:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.23,1:47:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,…用斧头破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.19,1:47:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？好像是不错的废品…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.55,1:47:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有点太多了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.14,1:47:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也想增加背包格子啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.98,1:47:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.19,1:47:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我回来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.05,1:47:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快快…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.25,1:47:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说来扭蛋扭过来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.17,1:47:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还没扭——
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.09,1:48:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.60,1:48:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.11,1:48:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.01,1:48:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,周围果然…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.59,1:48:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好像什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.67,1:48:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好，先回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.35,1:48:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不，继续前进也可以…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.18,1:48:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要搞不清了，等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.35,1:48:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,先回去…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.56,1:48:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才银色的废品是什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.38,1:48:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色是不一样的吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.81,1:49:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,废品变成20个了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.18,1:49:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哇～还是要选耐力吗～
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.72,1:49:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不，还想…再屯一点…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.05,1:49:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,停一下哦，那个…地图
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.39,1:49:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.67,1:49:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士挖开了…巴士的正下方也…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.61,1:49:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像隧道一样的…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.96,1:49:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那个也试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.01,1:49:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然主观来说也不知道赶不赶得上…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.76,1:49:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,…巴士
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.72,1:49:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.61,1:49:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,往下面…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.49,1:49:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士开始直直的……
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.24,1:49:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然只是大概，这个方向
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.85,1:50:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,废品真多呢
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.78,1:50:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,正下方有隧道…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.85,1:50:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像有…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.83,1:50:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道……？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.88,1:50:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,共乐{\alpha&H80&}(招牌){\alpha&H00&}……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.97,1:50:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，有吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.85,1:50:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,…招牌倒是能看到……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.64,1:50:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，像是吗，这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.78,1:51:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.97,1:51:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只是稍微登了一下，稍微有点li…太冷了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.93,1:51:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,成就获得，在屋外冻死
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.44,1:51:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像冻死了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.47,1:51:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不知不觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.64,1:51:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，刚才看到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.43,1:51:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶「死亡鲁拉」…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.44,1:51:40.09,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※死亡鲁拉：死亡惩罚较低的游戏中\N通过死亡来快速回到上一个存档点\N鲁拉是勇者斗恶龙的传送魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.22,1:51:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.59,1:51:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.46,1:51:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,能行能行
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.18,1:52:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴士…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.75,1:52:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,…有点暗呢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.92,1:52:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是这边吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.13,1:52:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不知什么时候
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.05,1:52:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,收集了好多罐罐
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.18,1:52:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？…说是充分的储备
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.89,1:52:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗，诶？但是不是隧道
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.85,1:52:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在地图上有写着通道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.19,1:52:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是通道啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.28,1:52:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,…这个到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.22,1:53:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.40,1:53:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.16,1:53:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？不错呢
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.36,1:53:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君出现也不奇怪吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.71,1:53:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.09,1:53:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,成就「还要捡吗？」获得
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.22,1:53:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说是收集了100个废品
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.22,1:53:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,都捡完了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.97,1:54:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.00,1:54:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.17,1:54:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.60,1:54:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多该回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.96,1:54:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶这里哪里哪里哪里咕嘟咕嘟
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.16,1:54:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,…变得相当斜了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.50,1:54:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.69,1:54:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…搞不清了，地方
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.88,1:54:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好，总算…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.81,1:54:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,回来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.25,1:55:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,40…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.78,1:55:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是升级力量吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.81,1:55:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还要14，再找到4个的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.98,1:55:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去升级吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.89,1:55:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,果然力量就是一切啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.62,1:55:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,…现在
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.09,1:55:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,木材有11个
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.01,1:55:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，夜晚好长？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.85,1:55:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，在那之前先…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.22,1:55:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想整理一下…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.19,1:55:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.50,1:55:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,想去，从巴士正下方…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.03,1:55:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然一直在挖
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.62,1:55:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？这不是隧道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.31,1:55:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好厉害看得好清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.57,1:56:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,家庭餐厅、洞窟…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.89,1:56:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.22,1:56:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是…家庭餐厅吗？刚才说的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.52,1:56:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅，巴士，然后…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.50,1:56:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,书店
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.59,1:56:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.27,1:56:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,书店没去过呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.25,1:56:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？那刚才的小屋是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.14,1:56:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.38,1:56:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道……
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.23,1:56:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,…不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.60,1:56:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没画在地图上的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.51,1:57:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,…不在地图上的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.64,1:57:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，那么…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.33,1:57:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,应该再往前走吗，那里
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.17,1:57:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不过书店也近呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.31,1:57:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,书店从现在的据点几乎往下…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.80,1:57:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,…几乎向下
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.25,1:57:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好难啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.68,1:57:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.35,1:57:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这边？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.73,1:57:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,书店…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.72,1:57:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.80,1:57:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.69,1:57:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.59,1:57:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还没在地图上的…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.08,1:58:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,地方被找出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.69,1:58:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,废品多谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.31,1:58:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘力量不觉得很厉害吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.71,1:58:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样啊，我的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.00,1:58:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是说挖掘力量就是最强的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.22,1:58:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有体力但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.17,1:58:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,…是那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.85,1:58:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不，又是老宅
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.95,1:58:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,先回去吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.40,1:58:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.25,1:59:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,用太多了？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.39,1:59:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没这回事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.77,1:59:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过相当亮，容易看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.62,1:59:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,体力升一格也可以…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.56,1:59:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再、再升一次挖掘力量也不错
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.93,1:59:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,体力，怎么样…好像也有增加的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.67,1:59:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好亮～
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.30,1:59:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.05,1:59:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉力量就是一切了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.90,1:59:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要体力吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.39,1:59:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,话说每次都忘记扭蛋
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.78,2:00:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该还有书店呢，等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.60,2:00:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,已经迷路了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.10,2:00:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,从家…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.31,2:00:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,直走这边…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.75,2:00:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再前面应该有吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.27,2:00:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,试着相信咯
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.92,2:00:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,今天，总觉得夜晚结束比平时晚
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.11,2:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.11,2:00:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.24,2:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不是……
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.61,2:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.42,2:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.05,2:01:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不对？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.09,2:01:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？地图上的话，不是这一边吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.14,2:01:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,像死路呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.56,2:01:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.72,2:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.05,2:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.43,2:01:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,已经装不下了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.09,2:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——不过背包槽位果然也需要吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.56,2:01:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也开始有这种感觉了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.06,2:02:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是只有一个啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.40,2:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,用18个废品，槽位只能多一个呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.60,2:02:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,重要吗，即便只有一个…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.64,2:02:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然感觉多一个也没什么变化…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.64,2:02:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会有变化吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.30,2:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——看起来是这边的啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.89,2:02:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,再往这边挖挖看吧，暂时
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.89,2:02:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…是那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.02,2:03:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道是不是书店，但找到建筑了哦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.56,2:03:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是书店…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.51,2:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为路不是直的…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.02,2:03:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是书店吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.64,2:03:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,招聘兼职，写着Book Store…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.80,2:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,从不可思议的路线到达了…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.63,2:03:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是，我的…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.74,2:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我家吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.54,2:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想连起来呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.09,2:03:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,连上了…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.00,2:03:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了～
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.31,2:03:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.03,2:03:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还会不会遇到小汪汪呢
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.57,2:04:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,村发生大规模火灾，多人死亡……发生过火灾啊
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.58,2:04:57.58,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.58,2:04:57.58,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}…村发生大规模火灾，多人死亡\N废墟被不合时节的暴雪掩埋\N\N7日凌晨，◯◯县◯◯郡◯◯村发生了\N波及整个村落的大规模火灾，多栋建筑\N被完全烧毁。虽然火势没有蔓延至周边\N地区或山林，但预计死亡人数在10人\N以上，目前整体情况尚不明确。\N\N同日，◯◯村遭遇了不合时节的局部\N暴雪，村庄在短时间内被厚厚的积雪\N覆盖。许多烧毁的建筑和道路已被\N积雪掩埋。\N\N据气象台称，在这个季节确认到如此\N程度的积雪极为罕见，可以说是反常的\N天气状况。
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.53,2:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,废墟被不合时节的暴雪掩埋…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.72,2:04:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,废墟…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.93,2:04:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,7日凌晨，◯◯县◯◯郡◯◯村
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.86,2:04:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了波及整个村落的大规模火灾
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.86,2:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,多栋建筑被完全烧毁
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.27,2:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然火势没有蔓延至
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.96,2:04:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,周边地区或山林
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.02,2:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但预计死亡人数在10人以上
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.39,2:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,目前整体情况……
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.15,2:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊好像在呢
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.24,2:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,尚不明确……
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.72,2:04:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,同日，◯◯村遭遇了不合时节的局部暴雪
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.19,2:04:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,村庄在短时间内被厚厚的积雪覆盖
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.57,2:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,烧毁的建筑和道路大多被雪掩埋
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.69,2:04:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,据气象台称，在这个季节确认到如此程度的积雪极为罕见
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.19,2:04:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说是反常的天气状况
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.35,2:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,据县警，火灾发生前
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.35,2:05:52.35,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.35,2:05:52.35,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}据县警，在火灾发生前，有人在村内\N及其周边目击到一名疑似女性的身影，\N手里拿着装有类似油状液体的容器。\N据消防部门调查，现场附近发现了一个\N严重烧毁的容器，被认为可能与起火\N原因有关。\N\N该女性的身份正在确认中，但据推测，\N她与住在该村的一名男性结婚，并\N和年幼的孩子一起在村里生活。火灾\N发生后该女性下落不明，县警方认为\N其有纵火嫌疑，目前正在追查其行踪。
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.31,2:05:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在村里及周边目击到疑似携带装有油状液体容器的女性
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.96,2:05:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这场火灾是人为的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.51,2:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,据消防调查，从现场附近发现了严重烧毁的容器…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.09,2:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,被认为与火灾原因有关
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.43,2:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,女性的身份正在确认中，据说是与村里男性结婚
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.60,2:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,带着年幼的孩子在村里生活的人物
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.64,2:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是刚才那个吗？刚才，小孩的妻子…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.55,2:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,出场的…不就是她吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.07,2:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,火灾发生后下落不明，被认为有纵火嫌疑，正在追踪行踪
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.14,2:05:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,村子
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.14,2:06:21.14,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.14,2:06:21.14,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}…该村位于山区，是一个小规模的聚落，\N近年来与外界交流甚少，关于居民的\N确切人数目前仍在确认中。现在，整个\N村庄被深雪完全封闭，县警方和\N消防部门正在就那名女子的行踪以及\N导致火灾的经过进行慎重调查。
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.32,2:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，坐落于山区，是一个小规模的聚落
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.22,2:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,近年与外部交流很少…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.88,2:06:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,居民的准确人数仍在确认中
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.93,2:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在整个区域被深雪封闭，正在慎重调查女性的行踪和火灾的经过
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.82,2:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说，因为大到县警无法插手的大雪…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.80,2:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.15,2:06:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体什么的，也可能正常地有
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.02,2:06:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性1｜喂，看这个报纸！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.85,2:06:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性1｜村里的火灾和雪！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.08,2:06:34.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性1｜发生了很不得了的事哦？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.48,2:06:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性2｜雪什么的……现在都什么时候了？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.19,2:06:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性2｜会有这种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.06,2:06:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性2｜火灾倒是场灾难…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.11,2:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸力
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.12,2:06:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性1｜好像写着女人纵火什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.73,2:06:50.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性2｜哪个村子？让我看看！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.13,2:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.67,2:06:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性2｜啊～
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.78,2:06:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～个什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.81,2:06:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,中途就…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.43,2:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我回去了的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.14,2:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，就差一个吗废品
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.33,2:07:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.42,2:07:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，中途…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.46,2:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,…对话，被跳过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.93,2:07:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还是刚才那样就结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.56,2:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「狗勾吓人」是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.90,2:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,差点被咬碎了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.22,2:07:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.57,2:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这样的话挖掘力量就能再升一格了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.18,2:07:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,果然力量就是正义
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.52,2:07:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.32,2:07:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,61，暂时先升到这里停下也可以呢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.28,2:07:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.07,2:07:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗，对不起呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.98,2:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了～
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.95,2:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不是来和你抢地盘的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.20,2:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗勾
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.69,2:08:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的书店
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.53,2:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不大吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.65,2:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,红色钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.61,2:08:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗勾勾勾勾
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.96,2:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然是最可怕的呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.97,2:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在吗……？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.17,2:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说是肯定在的……
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.28,2:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,废～品
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.60,2:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,废～品
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.70,2:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,废～品
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.57,2:09:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗？没有呢
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.00,2:09:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗不在呢
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.89,2:09:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.02,2:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在被发现之前，进去
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.44,2:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好，黄色钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.52,2:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.14,2:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.21,2:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不来？是哪边呢
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.42,2:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉声音好像很近…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.06,2:09:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,错觉…？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.48,2:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.92,2:09:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,…先回去吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.34,2:09:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会出来
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.18,2:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.70,2:10:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘力量变强了…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.35,2:10:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这一片全部挖开也可以…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.93,2:10:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.01,2:10:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,果然，挖掘力量可能是正义
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.91,2:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来……
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.10,2:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,积雪……
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.35,2:10:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,全貌…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.02,2:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就大体上…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.98,2:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话敏君…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.82,2:10:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也许能找到…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.14,2:10:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.53,2:11:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我变强了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.47,2:11:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在战斗中扎实地…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.09,2:11:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「变成最强了」
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.85,2:11:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,果然挖掘力量很重要呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.33,2:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后耐力什么的也能升一下呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.57,2:11:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近的雪
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.09,2:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.65,2:11:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掉都可以
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.08,2:11:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.79,2:11:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有备
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.56,2:11:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,无患
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.68,2:12:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉变成扫除游戏了？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.55,2:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，只要有力量提升什么的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.10,2:12:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会点呢
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.21,2:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不管三个…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.84,2:12:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好有趣，怎么办
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.60,2:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办，这种…作业系…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.03,2:12:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜欢呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.10,2:12:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,想全部弄干净
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.27,2:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是慢生活，对不起大家
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.59,2:12:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我又玩成慢生活了…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.85,2:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,玩成了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.93,2:13:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能挖的量多到让人怀疑其实不需要点体力
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.56,2:13:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要体力吧，这样
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.88,2:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只要挖掘力量就好了吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.45,2:13:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,反而让人想稍微增加一点背包槽位
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.31,2:13:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好，回去了…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.64,2:13:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有33个呢
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.43,2:13:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.87,2:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此夜晚……不觉得有点长吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.94,2:13:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,比平时…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.59,2:13:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有那么长吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.31,2:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.43,2:14:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,柴火挺多的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.28,2:14:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,48…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.75,2:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不知道，已经开始想再点一格挖掘力量也不错
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.50,2:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是挖掘力量太优秀了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.65,2:14:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的肌肉力量，现在…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.76,2:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,应该变得很不得了了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.57,2:14:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有挖掘力量的话，就不会为废品发愁
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.26,2:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,视野相当开阔
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.51,2:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,54
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.59,2:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.23,2:15:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉敏君会出来，都快忘了他了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.90,2:15:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,回收罐头
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.93,2:15:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,挖了这么多的话
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.83,2:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好…「村里的除雪要搞完了」
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.27,2:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,仅凭一个人的力量…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.97,2:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，60个…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.43,2:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,61…了解，少一个
Dialogue: 0,2:15:35.76,2:15:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,雪基本上…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.94,2:15:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,少了相当多…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.18,2:15:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，在哪来着
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.47,2:15:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.28,2:15:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,关东煮罐头
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.10,2:16:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时就…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.98,2:16:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样差不多了吧，这附近…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.77,2:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是扫除游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.44,2:16:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,回去，提升…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.72,2:16:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后进入的…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.06,2:16:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的书店吗
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.16,2:16:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「我是来给这个村子除雪的」w
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.03,2:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.31,2:16:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在比专业除雪还厉害了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.55,2:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬…这是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.53,2:16:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好像变了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.62,2:16:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好…上了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.09,2:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不再是铁锹了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.57,2:17:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好诶
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.04,2:17:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里小汪
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.20,2:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.94,2:17:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直永远地…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.45,2:17:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在忘记扭蛋
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.19,2:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大体都拿了吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.04,2:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗和…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.38,2:17:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:03.03,2:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,算了先回去吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.44,2:18:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后挖哪里好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.03,2:18:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:28.20,2:18:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay，废品27
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.43,2:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这一片也可以吗姑且
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.55,2:18:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，刚才眼前好像有地图
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.68,2:18:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,太亮就注意到了，看
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.59,2:18:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不用到上面就可以，这边更容易看…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.00,2:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.47,2:18:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,家附近的…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.39,2:19:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,书店，挖开了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.37,2:19:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,结果还是没看到洞窟啊
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.15,2:19:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,去看洞窟吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.86,2:19:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.77,2:19:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便，如果是27的话，升一下体力吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.02,2:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能除这么多雪
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.39,2:19:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就没什么可怕的了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.13,2:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪边啊
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.86,2:19:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在小屋更向前吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.22,2:19:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,方向偏了吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.49,2:20:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,罐头
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.42,2:20:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,积攒了相当多
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.56,2:20:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不过挖掘力量还能再升一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.66,2:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好黑～
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.46,2:20:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有点太宽敞了，搞不清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.25,2:20:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,道路
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.01,2:20:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.17,2:21:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不迷路…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.43,2:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.42,2:21:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,全部挖掉吧
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.21,2:21:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,全部挖开就好了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.89,2:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果迷茫
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.55,2:21:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,让它不会迷茫就好
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.28,2:21:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而且视野变广也很爽呢
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.54,2:21:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.39,2:22:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,体力果然不需要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.92,2:22:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,「有成就什么的吗？」
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.62,2:22:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，不清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.65,2:22:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「过于力量系的思维」
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.64,2:22:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.06,2:22:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有雪…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.92,2:22:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有路才会迷路呢
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.76,2:22:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让名为路的路消失
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.75,2:22:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,变成空地的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.29,2:22:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,首先就不会迷路这样的…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.32,2:22:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,…然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.67,2:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个是隧道啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.86,2:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有隧道啊
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.57,2:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.58,2:23:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,比这更进一步的进化是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.46,2:23:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？回到家了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.06,2:23:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.30,2:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,回家了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.54,2:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,转了一圈…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.54,2:23:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来，我回来了…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.52,2:23:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.23,2:23:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,扫除游戏…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.02,2:23:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且吧应该是
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.55,2:24:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.88,2:24:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然知道但是…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.22,2:24:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能变得这么干净的话就想弄干净呢
Dialogue: 0,2:24:14.85,2:24:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,58…以惊人的速度积攒着…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.11,2:24:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.73,2:24:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,背包槽位果然还是想要的…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.88,2:24:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这样看的话果然没有那么…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.21,2:24:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,特别…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.89,2:24:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,说特别宽的话也没有那么宽…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.43,2:24:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.20,2:25:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.18,2:25:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,64，几个来着？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:10.35,2:25:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,78…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.46,2:25:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就能升了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.89,2:25:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.98,2:25:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.60,2:25:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,完全找不到的是隧道
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.14,2:25:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,应该在小屋附近但是完全找不到
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.80,2:25:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,餐厅旁边，从餐厅往那边挖比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.49,2:25:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还要8个废品…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:05.75,2:26:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？就在这附近吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:15.10,2:26:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:17.80,2:26:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,餐厅…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.34,2:26:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.70,2:26:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,GV
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.19,2:26:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,M
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.52,2:26:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,M、Mov
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.68,2:26:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mov、Movies
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.25,2:26:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,写的什么，不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.22,2:26:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.21,2:26:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,直走的地方应该是隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.40,2:26:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.87,2:26:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,…是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.36,2:27:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有隧道呢
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.70,2:27:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上明明有的，正旁边…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.10,2:27:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Movies……
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.19,2:27:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上的话很近呢
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.16,2:27:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大体按照地图挖的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.19,2:27:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,以至今的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.31,2:27:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有的，按照地图
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.96,2:27:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:50.25,2:27:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.66,2:27:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,像是那个呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.11,2:27:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:28:06.30,2:28:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没有发烟筒了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:11.56,2:28:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可能挖的有点太宽了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:21.63,2:28:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好，85…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.51,2:28:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,121…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.48,2:28:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是这边吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.36,2:28:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒用完了啊，怎么办
Dialogue: 0,2:28:48.53,2:28:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.13,2:28:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不过很近很近，直走的话
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.66,2:28:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「都没雪了」
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.36,2:29:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,…没有了
Dialogue: 0,2:29:02.60,2:29:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没有什么可怕的了
Dialogue: 0,2:29:11.72,2:29:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.02,2:29:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是直走
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.47,2:29:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,进去…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:25.40,2:29:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了～
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.20,2:29:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是墓地啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.73,2:29:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么苹果
Dialogue: 0,2:29:32.30,2:29:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「（明明有花的话就能供奉了）」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.95,2:29:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,花啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.69,2:29:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,雪守家
Dialogue: 0,2:29:40.54,2:29:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,冰…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.81,2:29:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,峰家…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.78,2:29:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,应该念什么，冰峰家
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.26,2:29:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,冰…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:50.62,2:29:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是坟墓吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:52.54,2:29:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是说需要四朵花…？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.39,2:29:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,苹果核那边也有呢
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.18,2:30:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,花呢，稍微找找花吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.55,2:30:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能找到的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.92,2:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已经……不过，这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.48,2:30:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,铲雪的力量…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:20.01,2:30:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该足够了吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.79,2:30:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时来说
Dialogue: 0,2:30:29.60,2:30:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,除雪畅快畅快，也太丝滑了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.45,2:30:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,关东煮罐头…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.12,2:30:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,应该冻住了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.88,2:30:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这些罐头
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.94,2:30:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.17,2:30:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那条腿，我觉得已经可以走路了哦
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.62,2:30:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.87,2:30:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.62,2:30:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.13,2:30:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,休息
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.06,2:31:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「在雪里吗？」
Dialogue: 0,2:31:01.07,2:31:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是吧，大概…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.14,2:31:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,花…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:09.06,2:31:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个等一下，地图再一眼…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.45,2:31:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道是坟墓…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:15.86,2:31:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊与其说隧道不如说洞窟…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:18.65,2:31:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后家庭餐厅、巴士
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.09,2:31:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士站、街机…街机厅、帕青哥、隧道……
Dialogue: 0,2:31:27.04,2:31:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士的
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.21,2:31:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的隧道没去过吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.09,2:31:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,…那个是洞窟吧……
Dialogue: 0,2:31:41.02,2:31:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士后面的隧道，巴士后面的隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.71,2:31:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里啊巴士…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:05.27,2:32:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？巴士是哪个
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.53,2:32:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.45,2:32:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这里呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.82,2:32:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如何…往这边
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.51,2:32:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定应该有隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:35.53,2:32:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,首先，除雪…暂时
Dialogue: 0,2:32:39.77,2:32:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,迅速的做完吧
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.98,2:32:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,之后，废品什么的…诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:32:45.98,2:32:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走，就行…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.88,2:32:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然好像是巴士正旁边…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.90,2:33:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,挖太多了？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.27,2:33:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不过可能有花呢
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.93,2:33:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的全部…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:08.59,2:33:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,挖开的气势嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:33:11.12,2:33:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不用挖开那么多也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.97,2:33:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是巴士吧…？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.03,2:33:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这个吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.54,2:33:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不对，这只是…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:27.86,2:33:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,民房…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:35.59,2:33:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,民房暗暗的很好呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.04,2:33:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.61,2:33:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「铃原的方向感」
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.05,2:33:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的方向感歪了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.33,2:34:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉感觉感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,2:34:03.25,2:34:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.50,2:34:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又是死路啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.88,2:34:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:24.15,2:34:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.12,2:34:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,偏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.12,2:34:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可能因为微妙的挖得太多…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.98,2:34:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,更不明白了…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.04,2:34:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而且体力真的不需要
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.72,2:34:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,今天最好休息说是…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:00.45,2:35:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,太暗了…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.29,2:35:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都看不到……
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.60,2:35:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办，不知道回去的路
Dialogue: 0,2:35:11.62,2:35:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗，怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.50,2:35:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.32,2:35:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,变吸尘器了
Dialogue: 0,2:35:26.67,2:35:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,回不去…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.44,2:35:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.10,2:35:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:36.34,2:35:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.17,2:35:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.82,2:35:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.95,2:35:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.59,2:35:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.65,2:36:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，会不会是敏君…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.06,2:36:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜啊，回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.37,2:36:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜在干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.42,2:36:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不，什么都没做…哦
Dialogue: 0,2:36:14.21,2:36:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧大家
Dialogue: 0,2:36:15.67,2:36:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没看呢，照片什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.07,2:36:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,只有敏君那里被折过去了什么的没看到对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:36:22.63,2:36:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，可能只是我看岔了而已
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.93,2:36:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没什么深层含义…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.96,2:36:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，如果有什么怨恨的话，那个……
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.97,2:36:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,用黑色笔把脸的部分涂掉什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.47,2:36:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧，撕裂什么的，用刀在脸上留伤痕什么的，应该是那样的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.03,2:36:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个可能只是有折痕，那种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.04,2:36:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.69,2:36:51.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜啊，不
Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.90,2:36:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜什么都没
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.48,2:36:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没，什么都没看
Dialogue: 0,2:36:59.56,2:37:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.91,2:37:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,扭蛋机能转
Dialogue: 0,2:37:03.82,2:37:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.51,2:37:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有提升效果
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.34,2:37:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,跑的速度变快了…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:09.86,2:37:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,背包容量增加了，诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.34,2:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,砍树的力量提升了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:14.51,2:37:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,跑步的速度……
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.68,2:37:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,提升能力了……
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.98,2:37:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样……
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.51,2:37:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好暂时休息…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:31.52,2:37:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,搭话试试？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:34.86,2:37:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了？腿…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:36.89,2:37:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜喂山白桑，听我说！
Dialogue: 0,2:37:39.11,2:37:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:40.08,2:37:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我准备好洗澡水了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.66,2:37:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜铁桶浴
Dialogue: 0,2:37:43.37,2:37:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～那太棒了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.99,2:37:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶？洗澡？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:48.34,2:37:49.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你先去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.92,2:37:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜女士优先
Dialogue: 0,2:37:51.09,2:37:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真的
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.59,2:37:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,能好好洗的…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:54.52,2:37:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜谢、谢谢……{\alpha&H80&}我先去了{\alpha&H00&}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.81,2:37:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,暖和吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.96,2:37:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜在外面，屋子出门左转
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.87,2:38:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜在屋子旁边准备好了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:00.77,2:38:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:38:02.50,2:38:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那还是…非常令人开心
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.97,2:38:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能泡澡呢，大概也出汗了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:13.42,2:38:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,…先保存吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:18.21,2:38:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,屋子的，什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:24.36,2:38:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,2:38:26.51,2:38:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，挖不了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:38:28.98,2:38:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,捡起水桶
Dialogue: 0,2:38:32.72,2:38:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,收集雪…
Dialogue: 0,2:38:36.47,2:38:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:41.23,2:38:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,诶、诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:42.57,2:38:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要我洗雪吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:45.67,2:38:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,2:38:46.51,2:38:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～提升热量
Dialogue: 0,2:38:49.52,2:38:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.69,2:38:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还在想会不会冷
Dialogue: 0,2:38:53.59,2:38:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是点起火的话就…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:02.00,2:39:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？好像进去了
Dialogue: 0,2:39:05.54,2:39:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，真好～
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.01,2:39:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,会是什么感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,2:39:09.80,2:39:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不会太热吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:12.32,2:39:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哇～赏雪浴？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.37,2:39:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，真好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:39:17.13,2:39:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看起来很冷…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:18.66,2:39:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,即使桶里相当暖和了
Dialogue: 0,2:39:22.45,2:39:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会冷吗再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.84,2:39:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,外面……做成在屋里的也可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:28.70,2:39:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,反正有两层楼，在泡的时候去二楼…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:35.03,2:39:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说还是冷的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:39:36.96,2:39:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「下面有垫隔热板吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:38.87,2:39:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有这么方便的东西呢～
Dialogue: 0,2:39:41.88,2:39:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊，水会冷的，会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,2:39:46.25,2:39:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,出浴？也许出不来…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:08.27,2:40:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来确保我安全的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:40:12.46,2:40:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很危险呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:14.37,2:40:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:15.84,2:40:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在帮我放哨呢……吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:40:20.10,2:40:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喂是吧
Dialogue: 0,2:40:20.54,2:40:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜久违的泡澡棒极了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.62,2:40:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜铁桶这种也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:25.29,2:40:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然那个是挺好…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:28.14,2:40:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜嗯，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.01,2:40:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.72,2:40:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君很手巧呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:32.56,2:40:33.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜还行吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:40:35.78,2:40:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,点点点w
Dialogue: 0,2:40:37.13,2:40:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,沉默…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:37.48,2:40:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜敏，他怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:40:39.67,2:40:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜要是有在哪里避难就好了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.17,2:40:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哎……
Dialogue: 0,2:40:43.59,2:40:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜又是敏的话题啊
Dialogue: 0,2:40:45.47,2:40:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜真不腻啊
Dialogue: 0,2:40:46.46,2:40:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可是遇难中哦
Dialogue: 0,2:40:48.22,2:40:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那种家伙哪里好了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.92,2:40:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他现在不在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,2:40:55.03,2:40:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜因为过了这么久都见不到敏，有些担心…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:59.92,2:41:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～这绝对是干掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:01.60,2:41:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏、敏的吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,2:41:03.86,2:41:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哇～生气了ww
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.69,2:41:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.04,2:41:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜这里又没有敏，在这里的是我吧？！
Dialogue: 0,2:41:11.37,2:41:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜为什么不关注我啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:41:13.87,2:41:15.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:41:15.09,2:41:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:41:16.44,2:41:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏那种人，只会玩女人换女友
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.17,2:41:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜只会因为花心弄哭女人而已！
Dialogue: 0,2:41:21.72,2:41:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这样啊
Dialogue: 0,2:41:22.83,2:41:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:25.05,2:41:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山百桑不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:41:27.19,2:41:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜跟那种人处得好才奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.20,2:41:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么你们三个人来啊，那为什么来啊
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.05,2:41:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们两个不是朋友啊…这三人组
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.76,2:41:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,关系好紧张呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:40.39,2:41:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那么…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.37,2:41:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜友好什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:41:45.29,2:41:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我和敏只是朋友哦？！
Dialogue: 0,2:41:48.43,2:41:50.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不，敏不是那样想的
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.45,2:41:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜比起那种人我更好
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.54,2:41:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说了是朋友嘛～
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.62,2:41:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜为什么我一直被当外人啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:00.47,2:42:01.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.69,2:42:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.23,2:42:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:03.96,2:42:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了…？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.83,2:42:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜和敏之间发生了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:07.93,2:42:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜真是烦死了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:10.25,2:42:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不要再说敏的事了！
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.37,2:42:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜那么，我睡了哦
Dialogue: 0,2:42:17.45,2:42:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,变得神经质了，肯定
Dialogue: 0,2:42:20.46,2:42:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为干掉了！
Dialogue: 0,2:42:22.53,2:42:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为干掉他了对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:29.90,2:42:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可能这边虽然没有那种意思
Dialogue: 0,2:42:32.26,2:42:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要听到敏这个词…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:36.70,2:42:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会听成那样的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.62,2:42:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因为干掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:45.27,2:42:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好，第四天…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.27,2:42:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,14个废品
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.72,2:42:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只挖了能挖的，没拿东西呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:55.05,2:42:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？到头来……
Dialogue: 0,2:42:58.48,2:42:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士的…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.87,2:43:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:22.00,2:43:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里来着…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:28.75,2:43:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,已经变得相当广阔了…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:37.49,2:43:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,先回去吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.73,2:43:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:48.69,2:43:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.68,2:44:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,已经搞不清了呢，方位
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.94,2:44:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,23…30…
Dialogue: 0,2:44:11.55,2:44:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力暂时先这样吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:44:20.38,2:44:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,直直的往前挖，直直的
Dialogue: 0,2:44:23.34,2:44:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话能看到巴士才对
Dialogue: 0,2:44:29.20,2:44:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,然后小屋
Dialogue: 0,2:44:51.00,2:44:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的喵喵
Dialogue: 0,2:44:58.21,2:44:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在这附近应该…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:02.51,2:45:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,提示今天已经…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:04.27,2:45:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该回去了来着…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:09.18,2:45:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,用斧头破坏…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:15.14,2:45:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「长按就能挖开了哦」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:16.75,2:45:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，能挖吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:45:20.37,2:45:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，是扫地机啊～
Dialogue: 0,2:45:35.80,2:45:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不用体力的话，果然…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:39.02,2:45:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要提升体力呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:43.87,2:45:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好方便～
Dialogue: 0,2:45:54.12,2:45:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,2:46:02.65,2:46:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,到头来…没找到巴士后面的隧道
Dialogue: 0,2:46:29.22,2:46:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,到家的……距离
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.48,2:46:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗
Dialogue: 0,2:46:45.81,2:46:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,直走的话就是家呢
Dialogue: 0,2:46:50.11,2:46:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,2:46:57.55,2:46:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,收集了不少…
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.57,2:47:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,背包槽位最大…好
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.62,2:47:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,终于变成最大了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.01,2:47:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,雪消失到哪里去了…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:15.85,2:47:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,消失到哪里了呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:19.62,2:47:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.89,2:47:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:25.39,2:47:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,背包容量增加了，好诶
Dialogue: 0,2:47:28.12,2:47:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能拿11个了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.55,2:47:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,变的…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:35.57,2:47:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,相当轻松
Dialogue: 0,2:47:45.79,2:47:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:02.54,2:48:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把小镇的雪…全部除掉
Dialogue: 0,2:48:08.46,2:48:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直线回去让人开心呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:12.49,2:48:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就，也许不太会迷路
Dialogue: 0,2:48:18.42,2:48:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:23.00,2:48:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:25.99,2:48:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,…巴士旁边的道路
Dialogue: 0,2:48:30.97,2:48:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,挖开了呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:44.48,2:48:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,地图来说的话，明明就在这附近…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:58.14,2:48:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:59.19,2:48:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:49:00.38,2:49:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是…？
Dialogue: 0,2:49:05.23,2:49:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,2:49:08.35,2:49:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,2:49:15.61,2:49:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是书店啊
Dialogue: 0,2:49:24.08,2:49:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先撤了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:49:30.19,2:49:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,挖的方向错了吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:35.62,2:49:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这里…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:37.15,2:49:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,从书店斜向下
Dialogue: 0,2:49:56.41,2:49:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,书…街机
Dialogue: 0,2:50:18.43,2:50:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,2:50:21.93,2:50:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,遭重力遭重力
Dialogue: 0,2:50:25.80,2:50:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,73…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:28.94,2:50:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,总之，耐力应该还没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:50:47.38,2:50:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,高低落差…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:49.34,2:50:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:51.59,2:50:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让探索变难了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:51:06.93,2:51:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,斜下方…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:16.31,2:51:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:19.27,2:51:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,102…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:20.51,2:51:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,积攒了不少
Dialogue: 0,2:51:42.74,2:51:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,食物效果的提升也…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:46.04,2:51:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,扭蛋扭出来了…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:52.55,2:51:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个相当地…
Dialogue: 0,2:51:55.53,2:51:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,应该让雪地变的好走了…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:00.01,2:52:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,从书店开始…斜向下
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.32,2:52:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这边，挖开相当多了呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.45,2:52:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:21.43,2:52:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,更想让家的方向，餐厅的方向，据点的方向亮一点…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.79,2:52:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,斜右方直走直走
Dialogue: 0,2:52:34.84,2:52:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也有在下雪的因素所以不好认吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:41.53,2:52:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,路过了吗，没过吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:44.57,2:52:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有路过吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:52:52.01,2:52:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这边是书店对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:00.85,2:53:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,斜过来
Dialogue: 0,2:53:03.78,2:53:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得就在这附近呢……
Dialogue: 0,2:53:25.10,2:53:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:41.94,2:53:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,近的地方挖的太多？不如说是
Dialogue: 0,2:53:51.55,2:53:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,2:53:53.04,2:53:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,151
Dialogue: 0,2:53:55.05,2:53:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,能进一步提升力量
Dialogue: 0,2:53:57.73,2:54:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这个还能提升啊…差不多
Dialogue: 0,2:54:01.02,2:54:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么长得像火箭筒一样…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:03.72,2:54:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话，等一下能再看一次地图吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.72,2:54:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到这一片附近
Dialogue: 0,2:54:14.68,2:54:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再挖开一些吗
Dialogue: 0,2:54:16.70,2:54:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有像森林一样的地方呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:21.48,2:54:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再更前面？
Dialogue: 0,2:54:27.65,2:54:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,书店…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:39.37,2:54:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:43.01,2:54:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,森林之后再说…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:47.27,2:54:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底也去过了吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:54:53.93,2:54:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:54:57.46,2:54:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…这个？
Dialogue: 0,2:54:58.84,2:55:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可能是隧道
Dialogue: 0,2:55:02.47,2:55:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:55:06.59,2:55:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,2:55:14.95,2:55:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,终于可能找到了…
Dialogue: 0,2:55:18.80,2:55:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个啊
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.82,2:55:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等想先让入口变得容易找
Dialogue: 0,2:55:30.57,2:55:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，等一下…
Dialogue: 0,2:55:37.79,2:55:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？是这个吧，大概…
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.45,2:55:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:00.87,2:56:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是雪有点碍事吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:05.57,2:56:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，放一个试试
Dialogue: 0,2:56:11.82,2:56:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有发烟筒
Dialogue: 0,2:56:13.97,2:56:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不对，这个？
Dialogue: 0,2:56:21.45,2:56:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然像隧道…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:26.89,2:56:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有「进入隧道吗」之类的选项…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:32.90,2:56:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也许已经擅自进去了…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:42.80,2:56:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是隧道
Dialogue: 0,2:56:44.68,2:56:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是隧道，但是什么都没有…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:47.91,2:56:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,唔啊
Dialogue: 0,2:56:49.53,2:56:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明明努力找了…
Dialogue: 0,2:56:55.37,2:56:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:56:58.46,2:57:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是是吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:16.95,2:57:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,吸走好多
Dialogue: 0,2:57:25.56,2:57:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好…先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:57:31.50,2:57:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「没什么特别的东西吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:57:34.10,2:57:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢，虽然感觉好像有…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:37.43,2:57:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微挖挖周围比较好…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:40.56,2:57:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有点暗呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:50.73,2:57:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便，应该休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,2:57:52.84,2:57:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,试着吃东西垫垫
Dialogue: 0,2:57:55.54,2:57:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，完全不休息好像也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:58:15.56,2:58:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:58:22.79,2:58:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不…但是，已经是墙了…
Dialogue: 0,2:58:29.78,2:58:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,挖周围的话可能还有，有那种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,2:58:54.87,2:58:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,道具很快就会满呢
Dialogue: 0,2:58:57.19,2:58:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这姑且还是升满了的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:59:02.57,2:59:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,黑的什么都看不见…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:10.35,2:59:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，大概这个是死路…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:15.69,2:59:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:59:17.54,2:59:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不去反面的话不知道啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:21.13,2:59:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时把废品…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:35.13,2:59:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,书店…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:38.92,2:59:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有点凹凸不平呢，路
Dialogue: 0,2:59:51.52,2:59:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君，能找到吗，敏君…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:55.63,2:59:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,202…
Dialogue: 0,2:59:57.17,3:00:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,耐力我觉得真的不需要呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:01.31,3:00:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.26,3:00:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,…废品
Dialogue: 0,3:00:11.55,3:00:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不用拿那么多了吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:17.25,3:00:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时来说
Dialogue: 0,3:00:21.46,3:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,假设隧道没有意义的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:37.67,3:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让我先看看地图
Dialogue: 0,3:00:43.21,3:00:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,3:00:46.60,3:00:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道下面…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:48.70,3:00:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有帕青哥
Dialogue: 0,3:00:51.87,3:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去找隧道下面的帕青哥…啊
Dialogue: 0,3:00:56.52,3:00:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:59.63,3:01:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,3:01:11.34,3:01:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,总之走吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:01:13.05,3:01:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,柴火的话也不需要那么多了吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:01:18.44,3:01:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道，斜下方…
Dialogue: 0,3:01:22.83,3:01:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样看的话位置确实是按照地图，那就按着地图吧
Dialogue: 0,3:01:46.86,3:01:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,装不进背包了
Dialogue: 0,3:01:58.64,3:01:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:01.25,3:02:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「今天该休息了」强制性的
Dialogue: 0,3:02:04.26,3:02:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,被赶回去了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:07.13,3:02:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果、如果错过了什么演出怎么办
Dialogue: 0,3:02:15.05,3:02:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.75,3:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡鲁拉了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:18.45,3:02:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在好时机
Dialogue: 0,3:02:21.13,3:02:22.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那种家伙死了就好
Dialogue: 0,3:02:22.50,3:02:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我是女人们的英雄
Dialogue: 0,3:02:24.34,3:02:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我做了正确的事
Dialogue: 0,3:02:25.64,3:02:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜对
Dialogue: 0,3:02:25.98,3:02:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜这样就好
Dialogue: 0,3:02:26.50,3:02:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我没有错
Dialogue: 0,3:02:28.29,3:02:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:02:29.12,3:02:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:02:30.69,3:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要是没听到就好了，但是听到了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:34.85,3:02:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说了没做错事那种家伙死了更好之类的话吧刚才
Dialogue: 0,3:02:42.82,3:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「凯君真的干了吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:02:44.14,3:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——这个可能是干了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:47.46,3:02:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,3:02:48.89,3:02:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,突然自白了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:52.86,3:02:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了呢，不小心听到了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:02:57.66,3:03:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君，在嘟囔什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:59.50,3:03:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊装作没听到吗？嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:03:03.69,3:03:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜啊，深雪酱
Dialogue: 0,3:03:05.03,3:03:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜没什么
Dialogue: 0,3:03:06.18,3:03:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是啊，没什么那睡吧
Dialogue: 0,3:03:10.11,3:03:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:11.29,3:03:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜突然变的好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,3:03:12.25,3:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别太追问比较好哦，深雪酱
Dialogue: 0,3:03:14.48,3:03:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜哪里怪？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:15.50,3:03:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜没有什么需要深雪酱担心的事
Dialogue: 0,3:03:18.66,3:03:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我说
Dialogue: 0,3:03:19.62,3:03:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜昨天还叫我山百…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:22.53,3:03:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜为什么突然直呼名字？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:25.54,3:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不…挺好吧
Dialogue: 0,3:03:26.91,3:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,叫深雪可以吧
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.52,3:03:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜很奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,3:03:30.27,3:03:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:32.06,3:03:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜什么意思！
Dialogue: 0,3:03:33.45,3:03:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜被我叫名字就那么讨厌吗
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.92,3:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你超生气
Dialogue: 0,3:03:37.79,3:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为生气了…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:39.51,3:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不用那么钻牛角尖，深雪酱你…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:41.53,3:03:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜明明敏一直叫你『深雪』！
Dialogue: 0,3:03:44.40,3:03:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜果然那家伙是特别的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:03:47.14,3:03:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:48.45,3:03:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜真的好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,3:03:50.62,3:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙诶
Dialogue: 0,3:03:51.32,3:03:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜什么怪不怪的，我就是我啊
Dialogue: 0,3:03:54.05,3:03:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:55.52,3:03:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不过果然太好了
Dialogue: 0,3:03:57.29,3:04:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜只要那家伙不在深雪酱总有一天会朝向我的
Dialogue: 0,3:04:03.04,3:04:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事还是别说出来比较好哦
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.05,3:04:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜因为在这种地方所以变奇怪了吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:09.21,3:04:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜为了能快点到达广播塔我会加油的
Dialogue: 0,3:04:12.48,3:04:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜为了转换心情，从今天开始我在二楼睡哦
Dialogue: 0,3:04:16.48,3:04:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜诶，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:18.40,3:04:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我也去二楼睡好了
Dialogue: 0,3:04:21.21,3:04:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜但是…
Dialogue: 0,3:04:22.62,3:04:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君，腿已经没事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:24.72,3:04:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙，深雪酱正在露骨的尝试拉开距离
Dialogue: 0,3:04:27.75,3:04:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜抱歉…好像还不行
Dialogue: 0,3:04:30.32,3:04:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜依赖女孩子真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,3:04:32.76,3:04:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那个到是没办法
Dialogue: 0,3:04:34.72,3:04:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不…倒不是女孩子不女孩子的事
Dialogue: 0,3:04:37.56,3:04:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜…算了
Dialogue: 0,3:04:39.06,3:04:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜腿没治好的话，不用特意去二楼比较好
Dialogue: 0,3:04:43.20,3:04:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜那么……晚安
Dialogue: 0,3:04:46.79,3:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙啊，不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,3:04:51.79,3:04:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,特意…
Dialogue: 0,3:04:55.55,3:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那种会被指出的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:04:59.14,3:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉别说比较好
Dialogue: 0,3:05:00.94,3:05:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那就在二楼睡吧～
Dialogue: 0,3:05:04.75,3:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那，晚安～
Dialogue: 0,3:05:05.26,3:05:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜果然还是在一楼睡？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:07.20,3:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,3:05:08.14,3:05:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是要在二楼睡
Dialogue: 0,3:05:11.36,3:05:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那个互相呢
Dialogue: 0,3:05:13.68,3:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,明天也…
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.67,3:05:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一起活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:05:19.51,3:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,活下去呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:05:24.37,3:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,睡了哦～
Dialogue: 0,3:05:26.38,3:05:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,睡了哦。晚安～
Dialogue: 0,3:05:31.93,3:05:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗…？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:40.79,3:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音…？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:49.63,3:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,…谁？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:54.90,3:05:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜凯君？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:56.61,3:05:59.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不过腿，说过还没好吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:00.15,3:06:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜是错觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:01.37,3:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，刚才的是，凯君？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:08.59,3:06:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,…？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:12.48,3:06:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜…好冷…
Dialogue: 0,3:06:14.62,3:06:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜去厕所…
Dialogue: 0,3:06:16.32,3:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，一楼那边有个暖…不该叫暖炉
Dialogue: 0,3:06:20.05,3:06:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有个篝火啊
Dialogue: 0,3:06:23.75,3:06:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜…诶？凯君不在…
Dialogue: 0,3:06:26.94,3:06:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜算了，先去厕所吧
Dialogue: 0,3:06:30.37,3:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:38.72,3:06:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,先去厕所…
Dialogue: 0,3:06:40.72,3:06:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然脏但没办法，有就…不错了？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:50.20,3:06:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:54.55,3:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君…？
Dialogue: 0,3:06:58.11,3:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:00.62,3:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:03.57,3:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,然…那是什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:08.17,3:07:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，吓一跳…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:09.03,3:07:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶，啊，凯君，腿…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:11.46,3:07:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不，没什么
Dialogue: 0,3:07:13.29,3:07:15.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜一直在敲门，没注意到吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:07:16.32,3:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…没注意到
Dialogue: 0,3:07:18.20,3:07:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶……？对不起
Dialogue: 0,3:07:19.50,3:07:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜没注意到
Dialogue: 0,3:07:25.56,3:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊，刚才的是…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:30.85,3:07:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天，感觉很糟糕…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:34.79,3:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:39.04,3:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么敲门，因为担心我吗
Dialogue: 0,3:07:43.80,3:07:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,…不过，这个…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:45.53,3:07:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有像吸尘器一样的东西的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:49.37,3:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼也能吸进去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:07:52.31,3:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雪也一瞬间…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:56.05,3:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,化作…
Dialogue: 0,3:07:57.53,3:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,虚无了嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:08:00.09,3:08:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我走了～
Dialogue: 0,3:08:02.65,3:08:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想趁亮的时候探索各种地方
Dialogue: 0,3:08:16.43,3:08:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「《捉鬼敢死队》」是呀
Dialogue: 0,3:08:20.54,3:08:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个的话能吸进去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:08:34.75,3:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊等
Dialogue: 0,3:08:46.13,3:08:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要一点威力
Dialogue: 0,3:08:52.23,3:08:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,雪质可能变硬了
Dialogue: 0,3:08:59.52,3:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时，这个还在地图上的地方…
Dialogue: 0,3:09:05.02,3:09:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,帕青哥吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:09:12.21,3:09:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有点难挖了…
Dialogue: 0,3:09:16.13,3:09:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:09:32.85,3:09:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这边有点看不清呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:09:39.42,3:09:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是也推进不少了呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:09:53.50,3:09:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,雪质好硬
Dialogue: 0,3:10:00.06,3:10:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,入口到底在哪边…
Dialogue: 0,3:10:03.60,3:10:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…像是那个呢
Dialogue: 0,3:10:11.10,3:10:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒实在用掉太多了吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:10:22.17,3:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很暗呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:10:24.48,3:10:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,明明刚早上…
Dialogue: 0,3:10:35.63,3:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,写着日式老虎机
Dialogue: 0,3:10:48.16,3:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,明明应该大幅进化了，我的这个吸尘器
Dialogue: 0,3:10:53.51,3:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,比除雪车
Dialogue: 0,3:10:55.40,3:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,更…
Dialogue: 0,3:10:57.09,3:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有力量…我觉得
Dialogue: 0,3:10:59.81,3:11:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,废品有点装满了啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:03.95,3:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能再想想办法…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:17.38,3:11:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:20.71,3:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,打搅了
Dialogue: 0,3:11:23.92,3:11:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要大灯」是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:11:27.64,3:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个
Dialogue: 0,3:11:30.73,3:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗的声音什么的倒是听不见…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:36.45,3:11:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:11:37.33,3:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,扔一个吧，之后再来拿
Dialogue: 0,3:11:41.26,3:11:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗
Dialogue: 0,3:11:45.05,3:11:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,诊疗记录…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:45.05,3:12:25.55,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:45.05,3:12:25.55,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}诊疗记录\N\N患者：…\N年龄：…\N性别：女\N死因：头部外伤\N外因：申报为坠落所致\N\N诊疗经过\N患儿被送入时无意识。确认头部有\N严重外伤。\N进行抢救但未恢复，确认死亡。\N\N所见\N全身发现多处新旧瘀伤。\N关于受伤情况，有家属的说明。
Dialogue: 0,3:11:47.12,3:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,患者年龄…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:48.67,3:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,性别，女，死因，头部外伤…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:52.68,3:11:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,外因，申报为坠落所致
Dialogue: 0,3:11:55.96,3:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诊察…诊疗结果…
Dialogue: 0,3:11:58.95,3:12:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诶诶，患儿，被送入时无意识，确认头部有严重外伤
Dialogue: 0,3:12:05.84,3:12:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,进行抢救但未恢复，确认死亡
Dialogue: 0,3:12:10.93,3:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所见
Dialogue: 0,3:12:14.67,3:12:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,全身…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:16.25,3:12:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,发现多处新旧瘀伤
Dialogue: 0,3:12:21.68,3:12:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,关于受伤情况有家属说明
Dialogue: 0,3:12:26.20,3:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,备注，作为事故的负伤……
Dialogue: 0,3:12:26.20,3:12:37.70,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:26.20,3:12:37.70,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}备注\N作为因事故造成的负伤来说，\N显得很不自然。\N来自村长的要求\N「作为家庭内部事务处理」。
Dialogue: 0,3:12:29.31,3:12:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,受伤？
Dialogue: 0,3:12:30.70,3:12:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,来说不自然
Dialogue: 0,3:12:34.27,3:12:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,作为家庭内部事情处理的申请
Dialogue: 0,3:12:37.96,3:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,家庭暴力…？
Dialogue: 0,3:12:41.18,3:12:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,D之V？
Dialogue: 0,3:12:42.54,3:12:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,名为domestic的那个…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:47.67,3:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,旧伤和新伤…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:49.92,3:12:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}医生｜村长竟然会插手啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:52.63,3:12:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}医生｜明明还那么小…真可怜…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:56.68,3:12:57.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}医生｜说起来…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:57.64,3:12:59.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}医生｜你是那个村出身的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:13:00.48,3:13:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}护士｜是
Dialogue: 0,3:13:01.71,3:13:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}护士｜在那个村，那是正常的
Dialogue: 0,3:13:11.72,3:13:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么…？
Dialogue: 0,3:13:16.81,3:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,…？
Dialogue: 0,3:13:19.68,3:13:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像一瞬看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,3:13:33.01,3:13:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,…钥匙
Dialogue: 0,3:13:36.80,3:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有小狗啊
Dialogue: 0,3:13:44.35,3:13:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,给废品虽然很开心…
Dialogue: 0,3:13:47.76,3:13:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,…先出去一下
Dialogue: 0,3:13:54.55,3:13:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太暗了分不清方向…
Dialogue: 0,3:13:57.30,3:13:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是从哪里来的…
Dialogue: 0,3:14:07.61,3:14:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:13.62,3:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:14:16.94,3:14:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙，从哪里拿一根吧
Dialogue: 0,3:14:19.42,3:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒…
Dialogue: 0,3:14:30.92,3:14:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我没来过这边吧
Dialogue: 0,3:14:41.28,3:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好像略过了…
Dialogue: 0,3:14:55.55,3:14:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:02.55,3:15:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种地方啊
Dialogue: 0,3:15:13.73,3:15:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，能看到书店
Dialogue: 0,3:15:15.44,3:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:17.62,3:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「想要光呢」就是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:15:21.67,3:15:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不从…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:23.10,3:15:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里抢根来的话
Dialogue: 0,3:15:29.79,3:15:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这边用太多了呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:40.35,3:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不需要
Dialogue: 0,3:15:53.97,3:15:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,3:16:01.33,3:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然能照亮这边也挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,3:16:08.79,3:16:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,3:16:10.81,3:16:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,83
Dialogue: 0,3:16:12.31,3:16:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没增加
Dialogue: 0,3:16:14.65,3:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟没怎么拿呢
Dialogue: 0,3:16:23.17,3:16:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小歇
Dialogue: 0,3:16:28.36,3:16:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,然后刚才去的是帕青哥对吧
Dialogue: 0,3:16:31.62,3:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,3:16:34.45,3:16:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,…斜过来
Dialogue: 0,3:16:35.92,3:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,和上面有街机厅
Dialogue: 0,3:16:49.30,3:16:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士…
Dialogue: 0,3:16:54.39,3:16:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,太黑了认不出
Dialogue: 0,3:17:07.95,3:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:11.42,3:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:12.93,3:17:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:25.39,3:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好…到这里就能看到
Dialogue: 0,3:17:28.65,3:17:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好，这样的话总算…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:44.48,3:17:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:17:56.59,3:17:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，钥匙大概还有一个，有了
Dialogue: 0,3:18:04.34,3:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好，这样就是全部了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:18:16.62,3:18:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,柜台那边…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:19.16,3:18:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:18:20.10,3:18:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,3:18:28.69,3:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么掉了什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:36.34,3:18:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有了…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:42.48,3:18:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，没有呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:18:44.84,3:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好…出来了
Dialogue: 0,3:19:04.50,3:19:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要依靠发烟筒来…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:07.95,3:19:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,…回去吗
Dialogue: 0,3:19:14.96,3:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,3:19:20.20,3:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就不必去帕青哥那边了…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:29.56,3:19:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也想要更多光
Dialogue: 0,3:19:31.49,3:19:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就算有也很暗吧
Dialogue: 0,3:19:37.40,3:19:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「马上就变的黑的要死」是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:19:41.70,3:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不是黑成一片但也暗得要死…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:47.28,3:19:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:19:48.76,3:19:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,152…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:54.81,3:19:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:19:59.27,3:20:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪边走好呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:11.44,3:20:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,从帕青哥那边…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:17.94,3:20:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,斜右下方左右…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:28.80,3:20:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅
Dialogue: 0,3:20:31.95,3:20:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，正前方…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:38.88,3:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这里呢
Dialogue: 0,3:20:40.84,3:20:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边直走的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:20:49.54,3:20:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,3:20:58.38,3:21:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是地图上画的那个吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:18.15,3:21:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有点好像不一样…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:21.14,3:21:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,像民宅呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:37.08,3:21:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,挖成一条直线清晰的…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:41.13,3:21:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:51.02,3:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了～
Dialogue: 0,3:21:55.47,3:21:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅…
Dialogue: 0,3:21:59.20,3:22:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,应该…有的
Dialogue: 0,3:22:04.38,3:22:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,…大人，关于联……
Dialogue: 0,3:22:04.38,3:22:48.38,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:04.38,3:22:48.38,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}致…大人\N\N关于联名请求一事。\N\N恕我冒昧禀告。\N\N关于…家之妻、…大人之事，\N…的几名女子联名恳请：\N\N…大人身怀五个月的身孕，\N近来气色欠佳。\N然而，由于此家家主下令，\N不准村民帮忙，打水、搬柴、做饭等，\N依旧和以往一样，由她一人操劳。\N\N
Dialogue: 0,3:22:06.97,3:22:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,…的事？
Dialogue: 0,3:22:08.23,3:22:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,联、联名吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:22:10.87,3:22:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧禀告
Dialogue: 0,3:22:15.71,3:22:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,…家之妻、…大人之事，…的几名女子
Dialogue: 0,3:22:20.97,3:22:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,联名恳请
Dialogue: 0,3:22:25.01,3:22:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,…大人
Dialogue: 0,3:22:27.30,3:22:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,五个月的…
Dialogue: 0,3:22:29.51,3:22:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,身怀身孕，近来气色欠佳
Dialogue: 0,3:22:36.04,3:22:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然而，由于此家家主下令，不准村民帮忙
Dialogue: 0,3:22:40.65,3:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,打水，搬柴…
Dialogue: 0,3:22:42.86,3:22:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,做饭等
Dialogue: 0,3:22:44.62,3:22:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,依旧和以往一样，由她一人操劳
Dialogue: 0,3:22:48.70,3:23:34.70,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:48.70,3:23:34.70,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}值此严寒时节，\N若让身怀六甲之人过度操劳，\N恐怕母子都会有所不测。\N\N恳请村长大人能妥善处理，\N哪怕稍微减轻…大人的辛劳负担，\N在下伏地叩请。\N\N……年一月二十八日\N\N白岭家　白岭 雪枝\N雪守家　雪守 冬子\N冻原家　冻原 小夜\N冰峰家　冰峰 优纪
Dialogue: 0,3:22:48.70,3:22:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,值此严寒时节，若让身怀…
Dialogue: 0,3:22:52.70,3:22:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,身怀六甲之人过度操劳
Dialogue: 0,3:22:56.78,3:23:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,母子都会有所不测
Dialogue: 0,3:23:00.39,3:23:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,恳请村长大人能妥善处理
Dialogue: 0,3:23:05.84,3:23:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕稍微减轻…大人的辛劳负担
Dialogue: 0,3:23:09.77,3:23:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在下伏地叩请
Dialogue: 0,3:23:15.62,3:23:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,……年一月
Dialogue: 0,3:23:17.57,3:23:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,二十八日
Dialogue: 0,3:23:21.38,3:23:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:23:23.12,3:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有坟墓吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:25.62,3:23:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,优纪酱…
Dialogue: 0,3:23:27.72,3:23:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,小夜酱，冬子酱？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:31.14,3:23:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,雪枝？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:34.20,3:23:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,…吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:39.78,3:23:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长之妻｜老公，这个不是白嶺家的八重桑他们的信吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:45.06,3:23:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长之妻｜可以扔掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:47.36,3:23:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜当然
Dialogue: 0,3:23:48.77,3:23:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜对村子的事竟敢提出意见
Dialogue: 0,3:23:51.17,3:23:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜对这个村的女人是不可饶恕的行为
Dialogue: 0,3:23:54.53,3:23:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜你很懂这些真令人安心
Dialogue: 0,3:24:00.25,3:24:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:02.89,3:24:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么的钥匙…？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:09.70,3:24:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,出口只有一个…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:12.98,3:24:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:22.11,3:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个钥匙…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:25.45,3:24:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,「过分的村长」
Dialogue: 0,3:24:28.54,3:24:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说这里是村长家吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,3:24:33.80,3:24:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,村长妻子的电话…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:36.63,3:24:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是电话是信…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:39.39,3:24:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像看到一只手了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:43.77,3:24:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都看到了…？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:45.37,3:24:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在吃苹果吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:24:49.02,3:24:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:54.47,3:24:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谁…？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:57.65,3:24:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,血…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:01.09,3:25:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哪边是哪边啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:04.02,3:25:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这里也太宽敞
Dialogue: 0,3:25:05.64,3:25:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么什么
Dialogue: 0,3:25:07.85,3:25:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得刚才一直在一下一下的
Dialogue: 0,3:25:11.70,3:25:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,到底在表现什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:22.62,3:25:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:24.95,3:25:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,被勾引过去了呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:26.48,3:25:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,确实的…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:32.16,3:25:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是刚才的，家里的
Dialogue: 0,3:25:34.98,3:25:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对面吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:37.03,3:25:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,家，房间的…
Dialogue: 0,3:25:40.03,3:25:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，开了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:40.98,3:25:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:25:41.97,3:25:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,3:25:47.37,3:25:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那里，有些在意
Dialogue: 0,3:25:52.59,3:25:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？右边是不是去不了？
Dialogue: 0,3:26:00.61,3:26:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么去…？
Dialogue: 0,3:26:06.29,3:26:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？用斧头的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:08.42,3:26:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,物理性地破坏的话绝对更快吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:18.49,3:26:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能从这边走吗
Dialogue: 0,3:26:23.32,3:26:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,灰超级多…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:30.23,3:26:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙…
Dialogue: 0,3:26:30.96,3:26:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？之类原本有这么多能打的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,3:26:38.62,3:26:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我的话绝对用这个斧头砍翻一切
Dialogue: 0,3:26:48.45,3:26:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉拉门和木箱
Dialogue: 0,3:26:52.70,3:26:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,耐久度差不多
Dialogue: 0,3:26:55.23,3:26:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:26:56.15,3:26:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这里连着…
Dialogue: 0,3:27:01.05,3:27:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这里应该能开…
Dialogue: 0,3:27:02.45,3:27:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:27:07.43,3:27:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,全部，走过了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:27:12.56,3:27:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊，钥匙一把…
Dialogue: 0,3:27:19.43,3:27:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那边没过去呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:27:24.46,3:27:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？怎么过去
Dialogue: 0,3:27:47.27,3:27:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:27:48.77,3:27:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只是转了一圈回来了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:27:52.36,3:27:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，那钥匙也全部用完了？
Dialogue: 0,3:28:04.29,3:28:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,用完了啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:28:08.31,3:28:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那就结束了
Dialogue: 0,3:28:10.46,3:28:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像是结束了…
Dialogue: 0,3:28:15.01,3:28:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,探索完成…大概
Dialogue: 0,3:28:19.20,3:28:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然后帕青哥店……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:21.54,3:28:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个的…
Dialogue: 0,3:28:33.12,3:28:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,…应该有
Dialogue: 0,3:28:36.38,3:28:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗……什么都看不见
Dialogue: 0,3:28:56.06,3:28:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说有点想回去了……
Dialogue: 0,3:29:31.46,3:29:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅大概…
Dialogue: 0,3:29:35.41,3:29:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,…在附近的
Dialogue: 0,3:29:38.44,3:29:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,能找到街机厅的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:29:46.95,3:29:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就先回一次吧
Dialogue: 0,3:29:49.70,3:29:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行李也…
Dialogue: 0,3:29:51.52,3:29:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很多了…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:02.71,3:30:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,3:30:04.65,3:30:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:09.65,3:30:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:21.98,3:30:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也许是
Dialogue: 0,3:30:29.38,3:30:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也许找到了
Dialogue: 0,3:30:34.79,3:30:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,3:30:42.38,3:30:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏…
Dialogue: 0,3:30:43.39,3:30:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯像街机厅
Dialogue: 0,3:30:58.10,3:31:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,…好，暂时，撤了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:31:03.36,3:31:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,能回去吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:18.04,3:31:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,总算…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:34.11,3:31:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:41.89,3:31:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,废品
Dialogue: 0,3:31:45.22,3:31:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…不够啊
Dialogue: 0,3:31:48.86,3:31:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这里…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:50.96,3:31:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,直走的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:53.76,3:31:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,书店…
Dialogue: 0,3:31:59.29,3:32:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太暗了或者说，暴风雪也看不清
Dialogue: 0,3:32:08.64,3:32:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,3:32:12.08,3:32:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,久违的回来了，221
Dialogue: 0,3:32:15.81,3:32:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,进一步提升力量…
Dialogue: 0,3:32:17.64,3:32:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:32:18.52,3:32:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,变成最大了完全装备
Dialogue: 0,3:32:23.35,3:32:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,获得了
Dialogue: 0,3:32:24.69,3:32:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后请稍等一下，我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,3:32:28.62,3:32:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下呐～
Dialogue: 0,3:34:22.80,3:34:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,3:34:26.39,3:34:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让您久等了…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:29.09,3:34:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微拿了点喝的
Dialogue: 0,3:34:39.64,3:34:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:42.67,3:34:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,废品19个
Dialogue: 0,3:34:47.09,3:34:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,休息吧
Dialogue: 0,3:34:54.45,3:34:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:34:57.32,3:35:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，现在街机厅的地方…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:01.16,3:35:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,已经开了…的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,3:35:06.15,3:35:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好，去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,3:35:09.87,3:35:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,除了体力以外全部…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:13.62,3:35:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,拉到最大了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:35:20.77,3:35:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很暗呢真的
Dialogue: 0,3:35:25.86,3:35:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有一个一个作为路标的…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:29.52,3:35:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,光亮但是完全…好暗
Dialogue: 0,3:35:34.82,3:35:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔什么的完全在前面呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:37.25,3:35:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:38.70,3:35:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是灯塔还是什么来着…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:40.65,3:35:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,广播塔…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:50.31,3:35:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅…
Dialogue: 0,3:35:52.47,3:35:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，更向内部的是…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:00.62,3:36:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,广阔的太过头的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:04.32,3:36:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好，进去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:07.93,3:36:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅——
Dialogue: 0,3:36:10.43,3:36:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到街机厅很开心但是好像什么都玩不了…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:14.46,3:36:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,分娩状态…时长
Dialogue: 0,3:36:17.02,3:36:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怀孕满38周，时…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:14.46,3:37:11.46,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:36:14.46,3:37:11.46,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}分娩状态\N…时长：妊娠满38周\N…时间：4月7日下午2点28分\N…过：头位\N分娩时间：21小时 出血量 中等\N出生时婴儿的...\N性别、数量：女，单胎\N测量值：体重 2692克 … 48.4厘米\N胸围：31.0厘米 头围：3...\N特殊所见、处置：...
Dialogue: 0,3:36:20.91,3:36:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,4、4月7日下午2点28分…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:26.23,3:36:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…过
Dialogue: 0,3:36:27.45,3:36:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,头位，头…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:30.45,3:36:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,分……娩
Dialogue: 0,3:36:33.87,3:36:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所用时间…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:37.04,3:36:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,21小时出血量中量…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:40.84,3:36:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,生产时的，婴儿的…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:44.48,3:36:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,性别，女…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:46.69,3:36:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,…单
Dialogue: 0,3:36:49.36,3:36:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,测量值体重…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:52.06,3:36:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,2692克
Dialogue: 0,3:36:55.50,3:36:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,48.4…
Dialogue: 0,3:36:58.28,3:37:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是生孩子的时候能得到的什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:01.57,3:37:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:37:03.09,3:37:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,胸围31
Dialogue: 0,3:37:05.28,3:37:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,特殊所见、处置…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:07.50,3:37:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么，但是，重要的地方看不到啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:15.44,3:37:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}助产士｜恭喜！
Dialogue: 0,3:37:17.30,3:37:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}助产士｜是个非常健康的孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,3:37:20.10,3:37:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}助产士｜母亲，交给你了
Dialogue: 0,3:37:23.52,3:37:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了？
Dialogue: 0,3:37:26.58,3:37:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是不是不太会听到…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:30.78,3:37:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,健康的孩子哦是男孩哦是女孩哦之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:37:35.42,3:37:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是常见的台词…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:46.04,3:37:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有狼在的时候最可怕…
Dialogue: 0,3:37:50.70,3:37:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,狼都不在了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:37:56.54,3:37:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏，玩不了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:00.54,3:38:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，吓了一跳…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:03.31,3:38:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是flag吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:05.25,3:38:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,完全比狼可怕
Dialogue: 0,3:38:10.06,3:38:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我有那种地方呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:13.31,3:38:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说了什么的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,3:38:15.34,3:38:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为何就回收flag
Dialogue: 0,3:38:19.04,3:38:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在说完之前就回收了
Dialogue: 0,3:38:22.21,3:38:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，刚才也是，说起来出现了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:38:28.80,3:38:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还没全拿吧
Dialogue: 0,3:38:30.78,3:38:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说来也是，拿了钥匙什么的当然会来
Dialogue: 0,3:38:35.42,3:38:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:36.12,3:38:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只拿了一个吧，还…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:38.76,3:38:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不两个都拿了
Dialogue: 0,3:38:42.04,3:38:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好大呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:38:47.12,3:38:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,全拿了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:49.60,3:38:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「Flag即时回收播主」
Dialogue: 0,3:38:52.67,3:38:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢，被语音识别了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:58.65,3:39:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么不可怕啊，说的瞬间可怕的东西就出来了
Dialogue: 0,3:39:03.12,3:39:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有的有的
Dialogue: 0,3:39:04.09,3:39:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「真的好大一只」
Dialogue: 0,3:39:05.27,3:39:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢，真的很大
Dialogue: 0,3:39:07.36,3:39:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,吓了一跳，没想到会来
Dialogue: 0,3:39:12.27,3:39:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然…回去一次…也可以呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:39:16.87,3:39:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,边拿附近的废品边回去也可以
Dialogue: 0,3:39:25.34,3:39:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，去老宅那边吧
Dialogue: 0,3:39:29.78,3:39:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,已经装不进背包了
Dialogue: 0,3:39:33.32,3:39:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪里去会更快啊
Dialogue: 0,3:39:41.23,3:39:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,应该从街机厅去吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:39:45.05,3:39:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,应该从这个帕青哥去吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:39:48.86,3:39:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,…诶？诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:39:51.36,3:39:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,迷路了…
Dialogue: 0,3:39:55.34,3:39:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗
Dialogue: 0,3:39:57.70,3:39:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要搞不清路了啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:00.45,3:40:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,高度呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:07.04,3:40:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时这里也直走，直走直走
Dialogue: 0,3:40:11.20,3:40:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一般来说的话这条路，虽然好像没有光
Dialogue: 0,3:40:14.96,3:40:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,3:40:17.77,3:40:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,…能走啊
Dialogue: 0,3:40:20.25,3:40:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如此的
Dialogue: 0,3:40:22.01,3:40:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,崎岖的路也是
Dialogue: 0,3:40:27.70,3:40:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「地形奇怪的村子呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:40:29.73,3:40:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，真的有山的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:40:36.10,3:40:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，已经全部最大了…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:38.34,3:40:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这么看废品是不是太多了…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:43.06,3:40:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,背包容量增加了
Dialogue: 0,3:40:45.81,3:40:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食的效果…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:47.89,3:40:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食的效果…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:50.37,3:40:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食的效果…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:52.39,3:40:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食的效果…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:54.37,3:40:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食的效果变的很高的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,3:40:57.50,3:41:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,开了开了开了开了……
Dialogue: 0,3:41:01.70,3:41:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,开了开了
Dialogue: 0,3:41:03.66,3:41:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅……和
Dialogue: 0,3:41:06.22,3:41:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,澡堂吗
Dialogue: 0,3:41:07.52,3:41:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哇让人想起地狱钱汤啊
Dialogue: 0,3:41:10.32,3:41:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,从街机厅去好像更快吧…是吧
Dialogue: 0,3:41:15.24,3:41:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,话说从巴士开始直接划过去也完全可以
Dialogue: 0,3:41:20.34,3:41:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要走新路吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:25.06,3:41:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得刚才，在走很难走的路的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,3:41:30.22,3:41:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是不是没有…
Dialogue: 0,3:41:34.29,3:41:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,拿废品现在已经没意义了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:41:48.61,3:41:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:51.37,3:41:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士站…啊，诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:52.94,3:41:53.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜喂
Dialogue: 0,3:41:53.95,3:41:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不要待在这种地方！
Dialogue: 0,3:41:55.91,3:41:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,话说……
Dialogue: 0,3:41:56.24,3:41:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜你在做什么？！
Dialogue: 0,3:41:57.02,3:41:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,女士轻薄睡衣……
Dialogue: 0,3:41:58.92,3:41:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有人
Dialogue: 0,3:42:00.05,3:42:01.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜一直在等巴士
Dialogue: 0,3:42:02.23,3:42:05.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜待在这种村里，我会变得不像我自己
Dialogue: 0,3:42:04.87,3:42:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去好冷
Dialogue: 0,3:42:06.89,3:42:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜不变得像人偶的话，在这里活不下去
Dialogue: 0,3:42:10.53,3:42:14.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜妈妈她们给村长写了关于那个人的信
Dialogue: 0,3:42:14.50,3:42:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜但什么都没改变…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:16.65,3:42:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜在我被村子同化前，不从这个村子逃走的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:19.34,3:42:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，像人但不是人吧…？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:22.75,3:42:25.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜那个人变成那样，我觉得也是必然
Dialogue: 0,3:42:26.43,3:42:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜那个人…要是没有嫁到神峰家就好了…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:30.88,3:42:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,神峰家…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:31.99,3:42:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:34.00,3:42:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜和我一起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:36.63,3:42:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜我没关系
Dialogue: 0,3:42:38.20,3:42:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不来吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:39.52,3:42:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜不，不过…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:42.63,3:42:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～都能搭上话了
Dialogue: 0,3:42:46.34,3:42:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然大概不是活着的人…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:52.47,3:42:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…路…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:54.37,3:42:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上都连着的…
Dialogue: 0,3:42:58.65,3:43:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这，这边…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:00.42,3:43:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:01.37,3:43:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就能回去…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:08.07,3:43:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，看
Dialogue: 0,3:43:10.63,3:43:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说能回去…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:14.68,3:43:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是那样…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:21.82,3:43:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:43:25.70,3:43:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,喂——
Dialogue: 0,3:43:29.00,3:43:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那里，餐厅的地方…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:32.31,3:43:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是据点
Dialogue: 0,3:43:42.79,3:43:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,3:43:54.02,3:43:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是…什么
Dialogue: 0,3:44:08.50,3:44:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅已经发掘了…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:12.55,3:44:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到老宅我觉得还早
Dialogue: 0,3:44:17.50,3:44:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…不对
Dialogue: 0,3:44:25.04,3:44:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是街机厅啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:27.79,3:44:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,连上了…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:31.84,3:44:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:35.64,3:44:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦，那个，街机厅的…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:43.64,3:44:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,斜向…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:47.47,3:44:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,右下方…
Dialogue: 0,3:44:50.44,3:44:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是这边呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:45:02.73,3:45:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,往那边前进的话，大概……
Dialogue: 0,3:45:05.55,3:45:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:45:25.04,3:45:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？
Dialogue: 0,3:45:42.64,3:45:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事……
Dialogue: 0,3:45:46.31,3:45:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在迷路了
Dialogue: 0,3:45:49.65,3:45:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:08.20,3:46:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可能迷路了
Dialogue: 0,3:46:15.11,3:46:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～
Dialogue: 0,3:46:20.38,3:46:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是哪里…？
Dialogue: 0,3:46:23.92,3:46:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～
Dialogue: 0,3:46:24.54,3:46:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在街机厅…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:26.46,3:46:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:28.33,3:46:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不是吧
Dialogue: 0,3:46:33.42,3:46:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？要、要来几次街机厅我才能消停啊
Dialogue: 0,3:46:40.70,3:46:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有点奇怪啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:46.37,3:46:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，因为街机厅的斜下方…
Dialogue: 0,3:46:49.80,3:46:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是老宅才对
Dialogue: 0,3:46:54.41,3:46:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼打墙了
Dialogue: 0,3:47:02.43,3:47:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,弄错了吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:06.35,3:47:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,游、游戏玩的太多了…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:10.37,3:47:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没法从街机厅逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,3:47:24.39,3:47:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅说不定不止一个…
Dialogue: 0,3:47:39.35,3:47:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～
Dialogue: 0,3:47:44.18,3:47:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,试着朝向帕青哥店吧
Dialogue: 0,3:47:49.83,3:47:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话
Dialogue: 0,3:48:10.25,3:48:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:48:12.73,3:48:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅后面，变成这种感觉了…
Dialogue: 0,3:48:21.68,3:48:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哇～不过浪费了不少呢
Dialogue: 0,3:48:25.42,3:48:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是进去过的街机厅吧
Dialogue: 0,3:48:29.61,3:48:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,往灯塔的方向前进吧…
Dialogue: 0,3:48:34.62,3:48:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕要迷路了
Dialogue: 0,3:48:47.78,3:48:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,今天最好休息一下说是…
Dialogue: 0,3:48:51.93,3:48:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,想休息但是已经…
Dialogue: 0,3:48:54.46,3:48:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,已经，这里在哪里我已经不知道了
Dialogue: 0,3:48:59.50,3:49:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪里怎么走变成这样的？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:12.59,3:49:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不，就该这样回去
Dialogue: 0,3:49:15.44,3:49:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想回去也回不去
Dialogue: 0,3:49:17.77,3:49:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只能死亡鲁拉
Dialogue: 0,3:49:22.14,3:49:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不能用废品了啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:27.87,3:49:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,先保存成新的存档…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:30.20,3:49:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:37.96,3:49:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑，对不起
Dialogue: 0,3:49:40.31,3:49:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我可能变得奇怪了…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:42.26,3:49:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:43.11,3:49:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复正常了？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:44.60,3:49:46.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜想请你好好听我说
Dialogue: 0,3:49:46.48,3:49:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜一直憋在心里太痛苦了…
Dialogue: 0,3:49:49.48,3:49:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎、怎么了，难道…要自白吗
Dialogue: 0,3:49:52.66,3:49:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别，给我住嘴
Dialogue: 0,3:49:54.78,3:49:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜知道了
Dialogue: 0,3:49:56.06,3:49:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:57.42,3:49:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏他
Dialogue: 0,3:49:58.87,3:50:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那家伙，好像喜欢山白桑
Dialogue: 0,3:50:03.55,3:50:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了不要那样说敏的事
Dialogue: 0,3:50:06.38,3:50:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜…这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:07.83,3:50:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,3:50:09.12,3:50:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑也困扰吧，被那种人喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:12.30,3:50:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么用那种说法啊w
Dialogue: 0,3:50:14.32,3:50:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我知道了之后
Dialogue: 0,3:50:16.68,3:50:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜明明只是想阻止他的
Dialogue: 0,3:50:18.89,3:50:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:50:20.57,3:50:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜虽说困扰是困扰…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:23.09,3:50:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜敏是个好朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,3:50:25.33,3:50:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜正确地说，曾是好朋友…
Dialogue: 0,3:50:28.47,3:50:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜对吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:30.04,3:50:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,曾是朋友……
Dialogue: 0,3:50:33.48,3:50:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑求你了
Dialogue: 0,3:50:35.25,3:50:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜快说被喜欢上很困扰啊
Dialogue: 0,3:50:38.20,3:50:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不是说了虽然困扰是困扰嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:50:42.45,3:50:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜男女之间的纯友情不存在啊
Dialogue: 0,3:50:45.26,3:50:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你很清楚吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:47.20,3:50:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜凯用色眯眯的眼神看着山白桑
Dialogue: 0,3:50:50.46,3:50:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不过，山白桑不是那样
Dialogue: 0,3:50:52.76,3:50:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏那家伙很恶心吧？对吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:55.19,3:50:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜对吧…是吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:58.70,3:51:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么想让我说那种话…
Dialogue: 0,3:51:01.53,3:51:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛，这里配合说话可能比较能保住小命…
Dialogue: 0,3:51:07.13,3:51:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,即使如此…
Dialogue: 0,3:51:09.05,3:51:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也是朋友啊…曾是
Dialogue: 0,3:51:13.19,3:51:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,终究是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,3:51:15.03,3:51:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜话题已经结束了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:51:17.42,3:51:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我去睡了哦
Dialogue: 0,3:51:18.55,3:51:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜晚安
Dialogue: 0,3:51:21.40,3:51:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,话题，中断了
Dialogue: 0,3:51:23.36,3:51:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:25.89,3:51:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗…
Dialogue: 0,3:51:27.62,3:51:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,几分钟后？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:37.37,3:51:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,…？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:44.08,3:51:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在做什么……
Dialogue: 0,3:51:46.64,3:51:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是凯君吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,3:51:53.13,3:51:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:51:54.48,3:51:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在帮我放哨…是
Dialogue: 0,3:51:57.17,3:51:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:01.01,3:52:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以这么认为吧
Dialogue: 0,3:52:03.17,3:52:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…大概
Dialogue: 0,3:52:09.46,3:52:12.46,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,880)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 450 0 l 450 100 l 0 100{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:09.46,3:52:12.46,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,880)}{\fs64}（诶？…凯君果然…）\N（说谎了吗…？）
Dialogue: 0,3:52:12.80,3:52:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说谎了吗…？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:24.01,3:52:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,超稀松平常地走着…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:27.27,3:52:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:31.52,3:52:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:38.87,3:52:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:41.68,3:52:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在看什么…
Dialogue: 0,3:52:43.70,3:52:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:46.65,3:52:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:49.03,3:52:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,…凯君？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:53.79,3:52:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:57.12,3:52:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好～
Dialogue: 0,3:52:59.31,3:53:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,二楼绝对很冷呢～
Dialogue: 0,3:53:04.62,3:53:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等等难得在二楼…
Dialogue: 0,3:53:13.69,3:53:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没去澡堂呢，广播塔…
Dialogue: 0,3:53:17.67,3:53:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,街机厅…老宅
Dialogue: 0,3:53:20.90,3:53:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,得趁着天亮去…
Dialogue: 0,3:53:23.96,3:53:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好～
Dialogue: 0,3:53:25.85,3:53:26.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜喂
Dialogue: 0,3:53:26.92,3:53:28.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜发生了什么怪事吗
Dialogue: 0,3:53:30.10,3:53:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:31.53,3:53:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜不，和平时一样
Dialogue: 0,3:53:33.23,3:53:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？感觉昨天看到了
Dialogue: 0,3:53:36.77,3:53:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「（腿，没提已经治好的事啊...）」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:39.04,3:53:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「（但是也许现在不追问比较好...）」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:41.17,3:53:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「（而且好像马上就要到广播塔了...）」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:44.12,3:53:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:53:46.32,3:53:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在暂时什么都不要说比较好
Dialogue: 0,3:53:55.32,3:53:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也没法说天亮呢，好暗呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:54:03.06,3:54:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:03.79,3:54:05.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜我没关系
Dialogue: 0,3:54:06.52,3:54:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:54:10.62,3:54:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吗？那就没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:16.56,3:54:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在这附近狂挖已经搞不清了
Dialogue: 0,3:54:34.37,3:54:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,3:54:36.10,3:54:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这边？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:40.80,3:54:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:54:41.72,3:54:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,3:54:42.59,3:54:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:49.95,3:54:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这里是…
Dialogue: 0,3:54:52.69,3:54:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,进去过一次的地方
Dialogue: 0,3:55:07.79,3:55:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这难道不是老宅吗
Dialogue: 0,3:55:10.02,3:55:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也许到了
Dialogue: 0,3:55:35.55,3:55:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜那么
Dialogue: 0,3:55:36.39,3:55:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜距离村子的火灾已经过去数日，当地还在继续下雪
Dialogue: 0,3:55:41.88,3:55:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜不，以这个时期来说很罕见呢
Dialogue: 0,3:55:45.54,3:55:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜只用罕见一笔带过也很奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,3:55:49.44,3:55:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那确实是
Dialogue: 0,3:55:49.64,3:55:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜本就是雪少的地区
Dialogue: 0,3:55:52.40,3:55:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:55:52.40,3:55:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜也不是下雪的季节
Dialogue: 0,3:55:54.79,3:55:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜下起能把村子全部埋住的大雪
Dialogue: 0,3:55:58.28,3:55:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那是很奇怪啊…
Dialogue: 0,3:55:58.28,3:55:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜那倒也是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:00.19,3:56:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜气象台也发表了这是异常气候的声明
Dialogue: 0,3:56:04.43,3:56:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜直到现在也不知道什么时候能停
Dialogue: 0,3:56:08.79,3:56:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜我以前呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:10.67,3:56:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜在失去重要的人那天，下过雪
Dialogue: 0,3:56:15.39,3:56:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:56:16.65,3:56:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜竟然有过这种事
Dialogue: 0,3:56:19.00,3:56:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜声音全部被埋没，街道变得雪白
Dialogue: 0,3:56:23.70,3:56:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:56:24.31,3:56:29.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜那时候想，好像雪在帮我藏起悲伤
Dialogue: 0,3:56:29.26,3:56:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,被雪盖住的话…
Dialogue: 0,3:56:29.88,3:56:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜原来如此
Dialogue: 0,3:56:31.39,3:56:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜雪的话
Dialogue: 0,3:56:32.63,3:56:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜会让景色和声音焕然一新呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:36.42,3:56:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是那样…
Dialogue: 0,3:56:37.20,3:56:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,女性｜这次的雪，也有那样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:56:41.56,3:56:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜残骸、道路、房屋
Dialogue: 0,3:56:44.05,3:56:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜一切都染上白色
Dialogue: 0,3:56:47.59,3:56:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜将那村里发生的事…
Dialogue: 0,3:56:49.69,3:56:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜静静的包裹住一样
Dialogue: 0,3:56:51.97,3:56:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那样安静地包裹住一切的雪
Dialogue: 0,3:56:54.85,3:56:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜我没有想那么多呢
Dialogue: 0,3:56:52.88,3:56:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:56:58.65,3:57:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜只是感觉这不只是一场雪而已
Dialogue: 0,3:57:02.61,3:57:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜像是替谁哭泣一样下着
Dialogue: 0,3:57:05.68,3:57:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜我有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:57:07.97,3:57:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,3:57:08.26,3:57:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜这样啊
Dialogue: 0,3:57:10.20,3:57:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜我只注意到了铲雪好辛苦呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:57:14.82,3:57:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是、是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:16.91,3:57:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜一般来说是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,3:57:20.03,3:57:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜不过呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:21.19,3:57:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜一直下也很困扰呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:23.90,3:57:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜差不多也希望…
Dialogue: 0,3:57:25.31,3:57:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜老天该休息一下了
Dialogue: 0,3:57:28.17,3:57:29.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:57:29.78,3:57:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜所以说
Dialogue: 0,3:57:31.37,3:57:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜虽然有点变成沉重的话题了
Dialogue: 0,3:57:33.93,3:57:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜让我们放一首曲子吧
Dialogue: 0,3:57:40.87,3:57:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是后门…？
Dialogue: 0,3:57:46.11,3:57:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,入口在哪里
Dialogue: 0,3:57:48.53,3:57:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来，不大吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:57:51.43,3:57:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个老宅…
Dialogue: 0,3:57:56.45,3:57:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不知道从哪里来的了
Dialogue: 0,3:57:58.77,3:58:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是想回去的时候，跳到雪里…
Dialogue: 0,3:58:03.71,3:58:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只能死亡鲁拉了呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:58:11.92,3:58:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,进入主线了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:58:21.82,3:58:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,「不开直播模式的话会放什么吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:58:24.69,3:58:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～曲子，确实
Dialogue: 0,3:58:27.28,3:58:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也许会放…
Dialogue: 0,3:58:30.67,3:58:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是个好大的宅邸…
Dialogue: 0,3:58:48.03,3:58:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多入口也该……有了
Dialogue: 0,3:59:01.54,3:59:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,3:59:04.79,3:59:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～已经…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:06.74,3:59:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,发烟筒
Dialogue: 0,3:59:11.19,3:59:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:14.92,3:59:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是什么结构…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:22.34,3:59:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里对吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:59:29.95,3:59:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，好大
Dialogue: 0,3:59:33.98,3:59:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,像正门一样…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:39.73,3:59:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在挖雪的时候，平衡感…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:42.95,3:59:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过感觉广播塔近了很多呢
Dialogue: 0,3:59:51.12,3:59:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:59:53.96,3:59:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比想象的更…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:58.15,3:59:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,…大
Dialogue: 0,4:00:15.10,4:00:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说雪会掩盖什么的…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:20.15,4:00:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全部…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:21.36,4:00:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，都被吸走了呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:29.63,4:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,女汤…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:30.45,4:00:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？来澡堂了…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:35.02,4:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱钱汤…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:40.29,4:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,用斧头破坏
Dialogue: 0,4:00:41.53,4:00:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在没有什么想要的
Dialogue: 0,4:00:45.76,4:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,前半拿太多了吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:00:48.53,4:00:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶
Dialogue: 0,4:00:50.34,4:00:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,第一…抱歉，没有想要的这句话撤回
Dialogue: 0,4:00:53.54,4:00:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个就是现在最想要的
Dialogue: 0,4:00:55.08,4:00:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？男汤？
Dialogue: 0,4:00:59.62,4:01:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉地狱钱汤也
Dialogue: 0,4:01:03.91,4:01:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是Chilla's arts桑的……来着
Dialogue: 0,4:01:11.14,4:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,海报是……
Dialogue: 0,4:01:13.25,4:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？以为进了女汤，结果是男汤
Dialogue: 0,4:01:17.78,4:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？温泉可能涌出来了
Dialogue: 0,4:01:21.39,4:01:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,天然温泉…？
Dialogue: 0,4:01:24.51,4:01:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有点开心…
Dialogue: 0,4:01:28.86,4:01:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能泡澡了
Dialogue: 0,4:01:40.10,4:01:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,4:01:42.48,4:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶好诶
Dialogue: 0,4:01:45.63,4:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,最想要的东西，到手好多力
Dialogue: 0,4:01:55.82,4:01:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,捡起…废品虽说是不需要…
Dialogue: 0,4:01:59.42,4:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,4:02:01.30,4:02:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,村中？全村？
Dialogue: 0,4:02:01.30,4:02:03.30,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 490 0 l 490 620 l 0 620{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,4:02:01.30,4:02:03.30,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,240)}村规民约\N\N一、男人是上天委以掌管家庭的人，\N女人应当认识到自己是辅助、支撑男人的存在。\N二、出嫁的女人必须侍奉丈夫，\N不允许断绝这种缘分。\N三、离婚被视为违背村中教诲的恶事，\N必须严厉警戒。\N四、女人无论遇到什么情况，都不允许指责、\N责备男人，或让男人蒙羞。\N五、女人必须敬重丈夫，守护家庭，\N遵从村中的习俗。
Dialogue: 0,4:02:04.37,4:02:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,规定
Dialogue: 0,4:02:05.93,4:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一、男人是上天委以掌管家庭的人
Dialogue: 0,4:02:10.18,4:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,女人应当认识到自己是辅助、支撑男人的存在
Dialogue: 0,4:02:13.87,4:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一？其一…？
Dialogue: 0,4:02:16.94,4:02:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,呃……
Dialogue: 0,4:02:20.17,4:02:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,女人必须侍奉丈夫，不允许断绝这种缘分
Dialogue: 0,4:02:26.52,4:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,离婚被视为违背村中教诲的恶事，必须…
Dialogue: 0,4:02:33.90,4:02:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么戒
Dialogue: 0,4:02:35.59,4:02:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,女人无论遇到什么情况…
Dialogue: 0,4:02:38.79,4:02:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都不允许责备男人，或让男人蒙羞
Dialogue: 0,4:02:43.34,4:02:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,女人必须敬重丈夫，守护家庭，遵从村中的习俗
Dialogue: 0,4:02:49.55,4:02:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉…
Dialogue: 0,4:02:50.53,4:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,像是村子一贯的潜规则一样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:02:53.87,4:02:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个没用呢
Dialogue: 0,4:02:55.79,4:02:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「真是古腐呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:02:57.43,4:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,4:02:58.51,4:02:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,…警戒
Dialogue: 0,4:03:01.12,4:03:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不妙呢，各种合规
Dialogue: 0,4:03:07.63,4:03:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜这是村子从古至今守护者的规定
Dialogue: 0,4:03:07.63,4:03:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,又是收音机吗
Dialogue: 0,4:03:11.97,4:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是从古至今守护着的规定吗
Dialogue: 0,4:03:12.75,4:03:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}村长｜遵守规定，快点融入村子
Dialogue: 0,4:03:18.50,4:03:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在对谁说话啊那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:22.03,4:03:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说快点融入村子吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:26.54,4:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，啊啊…掉下去不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:29.55,4:03:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不行啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:36.40,4:03:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,泡澡…不喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:40.37,4:03:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪酱…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:45.10,4:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～
Dialogue: 0,4:03:48.20,4:03:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，厉害
Dialogue: 0,4:03:57.35,4:03:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan～
Dialogue: 0,4:03:59.14,4:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，去哪里的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:05.03,4:04:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,4:04:07.79,4:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么，太脏了之类的…？
Dialogue: 0,4:04:12.11,4:04:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:14.15,4:04:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么但其实没有吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:04:23.26,4:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…但是
Dialogue: 0,4:04:28.27,4:04:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不像能去的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,4:04:38.90,4:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么必须去的地方吗…？
Dialogue: 0,4:04:54.43,4:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,像是的地方，能去吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:05.54,4:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:05:06.66,4:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不行
Dialogue: 0,4:05:10.98,4:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好像需要一口气
Dialogue: 0,4:05:14.81,4:05:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch
Dialogue: 0,4:05:33.02,4:05:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,4:05:35.77,4:05:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能看到手…
Dialogue: 0,4:05:40.18,4:05:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,4:05:46.17,4:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,呀～ww
Dialogue: 0,4:05:48.24,4:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,4:05:59.97,4:06:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,挺严苛的呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:07.45,4:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不跑的话但是这个…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:16.17,4:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才明明过了
Dialogue: 0,4:06:18.20,4:06:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,相当…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:20.37,4:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,…接近奇迹
Dialogue: 0,4:06:32.52,4:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～糟了
Dialogue: 0,4:06:46.22,4:06:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微踩空了…
Dialogue: 0,4:06:53.62,4:06:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,4:06:59.32,4:07:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,温泉…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:02.11,4:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然想慢慢消除疲劳…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:06.87,4:07:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,太脏了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:07:08.70,4:07:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过当然脏吧
Dialogue: 0,4:07:11.39,4:07:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，跳过头了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:12.96,4:07:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地，很难控制
Dialogue: 0,4:07:19.97,4:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:21.47,4:07:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,豪迈入浴
Dialogue: 0,4:07:24.57,4:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,豪迈入浴也不错
Dialogue: 0,4:07:29.96,4:07:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好，出来了…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:34.96,4:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,4:07:37.97,4:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,应该再慢慢动吧，但是不靠一口气的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:42.22,4:07:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,跳不过去…
Dialogue: 0,4:07:51.84,4:07:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跳太过了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:56.39,4:07:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好…哼！
Dialogue: 0,4:08:00.04,4:08:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这次，太靠前了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:06.98,4:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,4:08:07.92,4:08:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好，过了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:15.57,4:08:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊…！
Dialogue: 0,4:08:18.95,4:08:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,超级可惜的说
Dialogue: 0,4:08:24.89,4:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好，漂亮
Dialogue: 0,4:08:28.55,4:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃的漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,4:08:31.60,4:08:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,4:08:34.79,4:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:39.54,4:08:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的是，初见杀…吗
Dialogue: 0,4:08:44.60,4:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧…啊……
Dialogue: 0,4:08:46.05,4:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好像慢慢没斗志了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:51.66,4:08:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,4:08:52.89,4:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，初见杀有好几个吗
Dialogue: 0,4:08:56.79,4:08:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,越往上就越…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:01.37,4:09:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:09:03.72,4:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,明明刚才很成功的…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:09.64,4:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:09:12.11,4:09:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,再需要一点气势…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:18.84,4:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好，Nice…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:22.13,4:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,4:09:26.54,4:09:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要靠前啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:09:30.28,4:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,难得好像能成了
Dialogue: 0,4:09:33.63,4:09:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,落脚点居然还会崩呢
Dialogue: 0,4:09:35.89,4:09:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～太过头了
Dialogue: 0,4:09:41.54,4:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,调节起跳好难啊
Dialogue: 0,4:10:01.50,4:10:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,果然只要稍微跑到热水
Dialogue: 0,4:10:04.85,4:10:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就不行啊
Dialogue: 0,4:10:07.38,4:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,热水…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:08.51,4:10:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是不擅长它的主角
Dialogue: 0,4:10:11.33,4:10:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然之前泡了澡就是…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:15.48,4:10:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地，不、不太顺畅呢呢斯…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:27.53,4:10:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好…Nice
Dialogue: 0,4:10:36.63,4:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好吓人…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:41.30,4:10:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,4:10:44.19,4:10:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有一堆废品吗
Dialogue: 0,4:10:50.13,4:10:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不需要呢～
Dialogue: 0,4:10:54.04,4:10:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧……
Dialogue: 0,4:10:57.68,4:10:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,…不需要啊
Dialogue: 0,4:10:59.19,4:11:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟废品已经…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:06.04,4:11:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说，等一下。想看地图
Dialogue: 0,4:11:08.90,4:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,地图地图地图
Dialogue: 0,4:11:11.72,4:11:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:15.53,4:11:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:25.38,4:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:27.35,4:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,略过了
Dialogue: 0,4:11:30.36,4:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,澡堂…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:31.52,4:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅是…啊，刚才进的家啊
Dialogue: 0,4:11:36.46,4:11:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，知道了知道了…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:39.23,4:11:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅，我已经去过了
Dialogue: 0,4:11:42.85,4:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那么终于该广播塔了…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:47.89,4:11:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:49.20,4:11:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,红色的地方…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:55.07,4:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,过去吧
Dialogue: 0,4:11:56.72,4:11:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？居然说最好休息
Dialogue: 0,4:12:01.36,4:12:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有声音呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:12:07.40,4:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且，走回去试试
Dialogue: 0,4:12:10.95,4:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有事件，说不定呢
Dialogue: 0,4:12:18.52,4:12:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太暗了看不清呢
Dialogue: 0,4:12:32.45,4:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，什么都没有吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:12:34.53,4:12:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里呢，我觉得可能是老宅
Dialogue: 0,4:12:39.26,4:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女孩还在吗，巴士站的
Dialogue: 0,4:12:42.94,4:12:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地死亡鲁拉回去也可以吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:12:47.40,4:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,名为事件的事件，也许没有
Dialogue: 0,4:12:54.31,4:12:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,话说对吗，往这边走
Dialogue: 0,4:13:00.89,4:13:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不行。迷路了
Dialogue: 0,4:13:11.32,4:13:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好，回去了
Dialogue: 0,4:13:15.01,4:13:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,4:13:19.37,4:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我、我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,4:13:22.82,4:13:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样，你还好吗？状态好吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:23.81,4:13:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜关于之前和你说的声音的事
Dialogue: 0,4:13:27.12,4:13:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜好像和狼啊熊啊那些声音不一样
Dialogue: 0,4:13:32.69,4:13:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:33.55,4:13:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜怎么说呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:35.26,4:13:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜该说是有点让人悲伤的声音吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:39.18,4:13:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让人悲伤的声音…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:40.18,4:13:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜声音？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:41.45,4:13:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:43.27,4:13:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜铲雪太多脑子坏掉了？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:45.54,4:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉突然好冷淡…
Dialogue: 0,4:13:49.72,4:13:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子坏掉了什么的…怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,4:13:50.29,4:13:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,4:13:51.58,4:13:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜对不起对不起，开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,4:13:54.31,4:13:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我也快能走动了
Dialogue: 0,4:13:56.57,4:13:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜那样的话能一起回去呢
Dialogue: 0,4:13:58.63,4:13:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜是啊
Dialogue: 0,4:14:00.27,4:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是已经…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:00.27,4:14:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜机会难得，我们要不要交往呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:03.88,4:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么难得？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:07.01,4:14:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜什么表情啊，我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,4:14:07.25,4:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对话脉络在…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:11.14,4:14:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你…不吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:13.26,4:14:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜啊…嗯，我还不饿
Dialogue: 0,4:14:16.95,4:14:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟，带了很多罐头呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:18.97,4:14:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜我今天就这么睡了
Dialogue: 0,4:14:22.05,4:14:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一直感觉很尴尬呢
Dialogue: 0,4:14:26.47,4:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,脚，明明能动了…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:29.05,4:14:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,却一直藏着掖着…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:34.14,4:14:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:34.98,4:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,zi、早上好……
Dialogue: 0,4:14:36.91,4:14:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜吵醒你了？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:38.00,4:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:41.05,4:14:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:41.97,4:14:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜说不定，我们…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:44.04,4:14:46.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜也许不需要求救
Dialogue: 0,4:14:46.37,4:14:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:14:49.06,4:14:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜也许是命运指引我们来这里的
Dialogue: 0,4:14:52.04,4:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说是村里的人，以前是…
Dialogue: 0,4:14:58.02,4:14:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我…动不了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:15:01.04,4:15:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天，诶？普通的第二天…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:08.87,4:15:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,故意来这里…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:11.01,4:15:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把敏君干掉…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:14.15,4:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,创造了这个状况的意思？
Dialogue: 0,4:15:16.22,4:15:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以脚也假装没好
Dialogue: 0,4:15:19.47,4:15:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好～
Dialogue: 0,4:15:22.03,4:15:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,4:15:23.74,4:15:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,无法搭话
Dialogue: 0,4:15:26.44,4:15:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其实想问你是不是腿已经好了这样…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:33.12,4:15:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,…好
Dialogue: 0,4:15:34.28,4:15:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,OK……
Dialogue: 0,4:15:44.84,4:15:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不过看上去也没想回去的样子呢……
Dialogue: 0,4:15:51.12,4:15:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还在，那个女孩…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:53.49,4:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷的样子…
Dialogue: 0,4:15:56.42,4:15:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜我没关系
Dialogue: 0,4:15:58.97,4:16:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}少女｜我没关系
Dialogue: 0,4:16:00.92,4:16:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吗…？
Dialogue: 0,4:16:03.35,4:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,说没关系的话，就没关系吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:08.73,4:16:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:12.52,4:16:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:17.37,4:16:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老宅…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:26.78,4:16:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,澡堂…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:39.25,4:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,4:16:46.65,4:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便问一下，转来转去会晕吗，大家没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:16:52.79,4:16:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,第一人称视角咕噜咕噜的转过头，会容易晕呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:59.89,4:17:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:03.81,4:17:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没问题」「没问题」
Dialogue: 0,4:17:05.42,4:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好那就好
Dialogue: 0,4:17:08.92,4:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:10.10,4:17:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:11.71,4:17:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不对，这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:13.45,4:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,《SKY PerfecTV！》电视台？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:20.65,4:17:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,电线杆…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:25.61,4:17:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上广播塔的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:30.78,4:17:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,能和谁联系吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:34.09,4:17:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:42.27,4:17:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一口气爬上去会被冻住…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:47.39,4:17:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这其实是不是并不能进去的…
Dialogue: 0,4:17:50.18,4:17:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,SKY PerfecTV室
Dialogue: 0,4:17:54.45,4:17:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「上广播塔直播吧！」
Dialogue: 0,4:17:56.85,4:18:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不是爬上广播塔就下不来了的主播
Dialogue: 0,4:18:02.12,4:18:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:03.65,4:18:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,视频…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:05.89,4:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,像创作者一样的…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:07.92,4:18:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的电影，有呢
Dialogue: 0,4:18:09.66,4:18:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么来着那个
Dialogue: 0,4:18:12.28,4:18:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,坠、是叫坠落吗
Dialogue: 0,4:18:13.87,4:18:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fall吗
Dialogue: 0,4:18:25.61,4:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上广播塔的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:27.88,4:18:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会爆红？这样的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:33.15,4:18:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,然后去爬了的…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:35.78,4:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,女性…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:39.17,4:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,网红…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:40.82,4:18:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,遭遇了…
Dialogue: 0,4:18:42.86,4:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了的事…这样的
Dialogue: 0,4:18:47.12,4:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有过这么一部电影呢
Dialogue: 0,4:18:58.44,4:19:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是旧广播塔，感觉…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:01.94,4:19:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,像是没被使用的感觉…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:14.22,4:19:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,4:19:16.71,4:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,高处
Dialogue: 0,4:19:20.13,4:19:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我怕高的地方呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:24.45,4:19:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,会被…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:25.99,4:19:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吓一跳…
Dialogue: 0,4:19:27.16,4:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,4:19:29.36,4:19:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,获得的成就，说是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,4:19:36.01,4:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是到了
Dialogue: 0,4:19:37.90,4:19:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,…到这里
Dialogue: 0,4:19:40.84,4:19:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「（得叫凯君过来）」
Dialogue: 0,4:19:42.52,4:19:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？姑且先一个人去比较好吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:19:45.50,4:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,4:19:54.40,4:19:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君
Dialogue: 0,4:19:57.42,4:19:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,4:19:58.92,4:20:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好战斗了
Dialogue: 0,4:20:01.73,4:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可以先换成斧头
Dialogue: 0,4:20:08.73,4:20:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且把体力
Dialogue: 0,4:20:10.39,4:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复成Max Heart
Dialogue: 0,4:20:15.04,4:20:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好，战斗准备做好了
Dialogue: 0,4:20:17.40,4:20:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,再存一次档吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:20:24.04,4:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,4:20:25.62,4:20:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,4:20:27.91,4:20:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君～
Dialogue: 0,4:20:30.34,4:20:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君……
Dialogue: 0,4:20:31.28,4:20:34.84,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,500)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 550 0 l 550 100 l 0 100{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,4:20:31.28,4:20:34.84,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(950,500)}{\fs60}从这里开始就不能存档了\N要存档吗
Dialogue: 0,4:20:34.63,4:20:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，会帮我存档啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:20:35.71,4:20:36.67,COVER,,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,500)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 550 0 l 550 100 l 0 100{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,4:20:35.71,4:20:36.67,REPLACE_TEXT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(950,500)}{\fs60}要覆盖吗
Dialogue: 0,4:20:38.28,4:20:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:20:39.20,4:20:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君～
Dialogue: 0,4:20:43.29,4:20:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:20:48.01,4:20:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏！
Dialogue: 0,4:20:49.85,4:20:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你还活着吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:20:51.23,4:20:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜太好了…
Dialogue: 0,4:20:52.98,4:20:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我还以为肯定把敏…
Dialogue: 0,4:20:56.45,4:20:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏…请原谅我
Dialogue: 0,4:20:59.80,4:21:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜…深雪呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:21:01.03,4:21:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:02.00,4:21:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜山白桑在外面
Dialogue: 0,4:21:03.83,4:21:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,4:21:05.46,4:21:06.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜只有凯一人正好
Dialogue: 0,4:21:08.54,4:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:16.36,4:21:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋了……
Dialogue: 0,4:21:18.87,4:21:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜…！
Dialogue: 0,4:21:20.52,4:21:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪你什么时候…？
Dialogue: 0,4:21:21.76,4:21:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜刚才的那个你没……
Dialogue: 0,4:21:22.66,4:21:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜不、不对，凯是那个……
Dialogue: 0,4:21:26.93,4:21:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜现在再掩盖也来不及了
Dialogue: 0,4:21:29.20,4:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…可能不行…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:29.80,4:21:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜看到了就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,4:21:31.87,4:21:33.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪也要拜拜了呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:34.88,4:21:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜吗
Dialogue: 0,4:21:36.07,4:21:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「（得逃走！）」
Dialogue: 0,4:21:41.16,4:21:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,4:21:43.08,4:21:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:46.95,4:21:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:21:49.67,4:21:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,得逃走，好什么都没发生过，不错
Dialogue: 0,4:21:54.96,4:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:21:56.77,4:21:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像必须逃走
Dialogue: 0,4:22:00.19,4:22:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟得上我的雪路吗
Dialogue: 0,4:22:03.42,4:22:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜没事的呀
Dialogue: 0,4:22:04.86,4:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,4:22:12.67,4:22:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那附近，有很多废品
Dialogue: 0,4:22:16.04,4:22:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,存起来的
Dialogue: 0,4:22:17.14,4:22:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,4:22:18.44,4:22:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜果然还是来聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,4:22:21.98,4:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,聊什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:22:24.04,4:22:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,到底……
Dialogue: 0,4:22:26.43,4:22:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，路这边对吗
Dialogue: 0,4:22:30.11,4:22:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对了对了绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,4:22:33.53,4:22:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪～
Dialogue: 0,4:22:36.05,4:22:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,4:22:39.62,4:22:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,本来以为凯君是…不妙的家伙
Dialogue: 0,4:22:42.39,4:22:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,把敏君干掉了…
Dialogue: 0,4:22:45.64,4:22:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,两边都是糟糕的家伙
Dialogue: 0,4:22:47.38,4:22:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,两边都很不妙这没错吧
Dialogue: 0,4:22:48.41,4:22:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜喂，给我站住
Dialogue: 0,4:22:52.47,4:22:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给我等一下啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:22:54.69,4:22:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,被说等一下就等的人有吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:22:59.51,4:23:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,4:23:00.48,4:23:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,到了到了
Dialogue: 0,4:23:03.49,4:23:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜美雪～
Dialogue: 0,4:23:04.89,4:23:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么～？
Dialogue: 0,4:23:08.27,4:23:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,搞快点
Dialogue: 0,4:23:12.62,4:23:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不快点的话来不及…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:14.29,4:23:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:16.20,4:23:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你有被追的自觉吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:22.75,4:23:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:23:23.93,4:23:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:27.79,4:23:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:28.24,4:23:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜这样下去我也会被杀掉…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:30.61,4:23:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜得快点…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:33.00,4:23:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，我也…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:34.34,4:23:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不
Dialogue: 0,4:23:41.29,4:23:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕好像很冷…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:43.90,4:23:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要冻住了
Dialogue: 0,4:23:46.73,4:23:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,4:23:48.32,4:23:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像要冻住了
Dialogue: 0,4:23:51.32,4:23:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,已经，要冻住了
Dialogue: 0,4:23:58.12,4:23:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好像勉强赶上了
Dialogue: 0,4:24:03.65,4:24:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说敏和凯，两边都被干掉了
Dialogue: 0,4:24:09.44,4:24:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太Nice力～
Dialogue: 0,4:24:13.34,4:24:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:24:14.49,4:24:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,4:24:16.07,4:24:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,物理攻击…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:18.37,4:24:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对鬼没用
Dialogue: 0,4:24:23.73,4:24:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办好？
Dialogue: 0,4:24:26.55,4:24:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜诶？刚才…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:35.14,4:24:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这种又高又一目了然的地方大家都能上来吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:24:39.72,4:24:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是电话啊
Dialogue: 0,4:24:41.85,4:24:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能打通吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:45.01,4:24:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急时刻请按按钮
Dialogue: 0,4:24:54.11,4:24:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:24:57.02,4:24:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「这个再怎么说都不行……太可怕了w」
Dialogue: 0,4:25:00.37,4:25:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,话说还在下雪，视野不好反而好呢
Dialogue: 0,4:25:03.98,4:25:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜…为什么不接？！
Dialogue: 0,4:25:06.19,4:25:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:07.59,4:25:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:20.21,4:25:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？有人来了…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:28.03,4:25:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙……
Dialogue: 0,4:25:28.45,4:25:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}深雪｜好冷……
Dialogue: 0,4:25:29.85,4:25:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要冻住了……
Dialogue: 0,4:25:30.74,4:25:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种高处
Dialogue: 0,4:25:33.14,4:25:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:34.89,4:25:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad End？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:37.37,4:25:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都救不了…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:44.59,4:25:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,凯君也、敏君也、鬼也…
Dialogue: 0,4:25:48.51,4:25:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？结束了？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:53.17,4:25:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:25:56.09,4:25:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，结束了
Dialogue: 0,4:26:02.55,4:26:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,4:26:09.99,4:26:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么，什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:12.45,4:26:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,4:26:16.23,4:26:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:19.70,4:26:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是说要在坟前做点什么的意思？
Dialogue: 0,4:26:28.26,4:26:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,得叫凯君过来……
Dialogue: 0,4:26:31.15,4:26:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像Bad End…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:36.21,4:26:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,的…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:42.45,4:26:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会坟墓有关…刚才不是出现了洞窟一样的东西…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:47.31,4:26:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:48.44,4:26:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从时钟…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:54.39,4:26:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，花难道是指…
Dialogue: 0,4:26:58.87,4:26:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:01.79,4:27:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不过有一个很奇怪啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:05.36,4:27:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还没，开花…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:09.42,4:27:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还在想没什么花这种东西，结果有的
Dialogue: 0,4:27:16.34,4:27:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,给大家花…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:20.31,4:27:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:23.48,4:27:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是这
Dialogue: 0,4:27:26.00,4:27:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,诶但是为什么，时钟…不知道为什么要给我看…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:30.94,4:27:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,少一朵吧
Dialogue: 0,4:27:39.35,4:27:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不
Dialogue: 0,4:27:40.37,4:27:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好，可能没问题…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:44.44,4:27:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，不过有一个…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:49.38,4:27:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,得叫凯过来…
Dialogue: 0,4:27:50.81,4:27:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,视野有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,4:28:02.05,4:28:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这视野是什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:28:05.08,4:28:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,变红了。能再进去一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:28:11.14,4:28:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这个还是花苞的花令人在意
Dialogue: 0,4:28:20.06,4:28:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,算了先试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,4:28:33.71,4:28:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一样的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:28:35.98,4:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然还是很红
Dialogue: 0,4:28:35.98,4:28:36.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏！
Dialogue: 0,4:28:38.03,4:28:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:28:38.03,4:28:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜你还活着吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:28:39.23,4:28:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,变近了
Dialogue: 0,4:28:39.23,4:28:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜太好了……
Dialogue: 0,4:28:41.14,4:28:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才…
Dialogue: 0,4:28:41.14,4:28:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜我还以为肯定把敏…
Dialogue: 0,4:28:44.63,4:28:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}凯｜敏…请原谅我
Dialogue: 0,4:28:46.48,4:28:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才不是从更远的地方看吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:28:47.82,4:28:48.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜…深雪呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:28:49.18,4:28:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜啊…山白桑的话在外面
Dialogue: 0,4:28:52.01,4:28:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,4:28:53.63,4:28:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜只有凯一人正好
Dialogue: 0,4:28:57.79,4:29:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，凯君是不是还活着？怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,4:29:07.02,4:29:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜…！
Dialogue: 0,4:29:08.75,4:29:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪你什么时候？刚才的你没…
Dialogue: 0,4:29:10.81,4:29:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜不、不对，凯是那个……
Dialogue: 0,4:29:11.19,4:29:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是这样的吗？还是就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,4:29:15.10,4:29:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜现在再掩饰也晚了
Dialogue: 0,4:29:15.48,4:29:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:29:17.94,4:29:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜看到了就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,4:29:20.12,4:29:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪也要拜拜了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:29:23.92,4:29:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,得逃掉
Dialogue: 0,4:29:25.80,4:29:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只能逃了吗暂时…
Dialogue: 0,4:29:37.42,4:29:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪～
Dialogue: 0,4:29:38.39,4:29:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}是～
Dialogue: 0,4:29:47.90,4:29:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有点在意…
Dialogue: 0,4:29:52.30,4:29:53.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪～
Dialogue: 0,4:29:53.60,4:29:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,4:30:00.68,4:30:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…时、时钟…
Dialogue: 0,4:30:04.84,4:30:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,和，你…
Dialogue: 0,4:30:07.04,4:30:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜没事的呀
Dialogue: 0,4:30:10.57,4:30:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,4:30:13.73,4:30:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:30:21.21,4:30:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:30:23.46,4:30:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,被干掉了…
Dialogue: 0,4:30:25.64,4:30:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,失败力～
Dialogue: 0,4:30:30.12,4:30:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得逃走，好，这次一定
Dialogue: 0,4:30:33.26,4:30:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，最后的镜头有点在意
Dialogue: 0,4:30:42.39,4:30:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,4:30:43.70,4:30:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想再试一个
Dialogue: 0,4:30:47.10,4:30:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,进不去…OKOK
Dialogue: 0,4:30:56.57,4:30:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，前往
Dialogue: 0,4:30:58.71,4:31:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,会变吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:01.85,4:31:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,4:31:04.43,4:31:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉突然
Dialogue: 0,4:31:07.56,4:31:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这种音乐之前有吗
Dialogue: 0,4:31:14.00,4:31:15.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜果然还是聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,4:31:16.44,4:31:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不行呢～
Dialogue: 0,4:31:18.81,4:31:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,聊不成呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:23.02,4:31:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:25.47,4:31:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在大概，就在后面吧…？
Dialogue: 0,4:31:29.02,4:31:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜深雪～
Dialogue: 0,4:31:30.61,4:31:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,4:31:37.79,4:31:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得相当近呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:44.09,4:31:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}敏｜逃也没用哦…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:47.77,4:31:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:56.95,4:31:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:57.93,4:31:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧，赶紧赶紧…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:03.94,4:32:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么，绊倒了？我
Dialogue: 0,4:32:10.45,4:32:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:12.56,4:32:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,又救了我…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:15.60,4:32:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不…这是来救我的吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:18.76,4:32:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,…不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:32:27.59,4:32:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况了？
Dialogue: 0,4:32:38.39,4:32:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…？
Dialogue: 0,4:32:41.80,4:32:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:32:42.57,4:32:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:47.23,4:32:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我，活下来了…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:49.59,4:32:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我这真还活着吗……
Dialogue: 0,4:32:52.81,4:32:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:55.78,4:32:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:05.20,4:33:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,成佛了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:11.18,4:33:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，天晴了～
Dialogue: 0,4:33:15.89,4:33:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，广播塔，诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:21.49,4:33:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没下雪…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:24.98,4:33:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,餐厅也…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:27.75,4:33:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么，我…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:30.27,4:33:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,做了梦
Dialogue: 0,4:33:34.27,4:33:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:37.61,4:33:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君和凯君呢
Dialogue: 0,4:33:42.41,4:33:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,大家呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:46.22,4:33:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…？结束了～
Dialogue: 0,4:33:50.25,4:33:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是好好的通关了的意思吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:52.74,4:33:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真正的结局？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:55.47,4:33:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这首歌，可以放心的在YouTube上使用…
Dialogue: 0,4:33:59.47,4:34:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,4:34:00.43,4:34:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为在直播中用吗
Dialogue: 0,4:34:02.88,4:34:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一点声音都没有呢
Dialogue: 0,4:34:05.83,4:34:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音都没有
Dialogue: 0,4:34:08.04,4:34:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但是通关了～
Dialogue: 0,4:34:12.23,4:34:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,生存End…
Dialogue: 0,4:34:17.72,4:34:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,4:34:19.74,4:34:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「通关恭喜」谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,4:34:23.83,4:34:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,已经但是，谢谢谢谢
Dialogue: 0,4:34:28.97,4:34:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,村子恢复了吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:34:33.04,4:34:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，因为我解开了真相，献上了花…
Dialogue: 0,4:34:38.49,4:34:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被雪隐藏的村子重新显现…
Dialogue: 0,4:34:43.25,4:34:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,终于，大家能成佛了吗…
Dialogue: 0,4:34:48.77,4:34:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,「怎么感觉一直在铲雪w」
Dialogue: 0,4:34:51.13,4:34:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,确实ww
Dialogue: 0,4:34:52.84,4:34:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在铲呢～
Dialogue: 0,4:34:56.65,4:34:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「通关Nice」谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,4:34:58.99,4:35:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,通关了～
Dialogue: 0,4:35:02.05,4:35:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,总之最后…只有我生存着…
Dialogue: 0,4:35:05.63,4:35:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,4:35:06.79,4:35:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,全部是深雪酱的妄想这个说法也不可忽视
Dialogue: 0,4:35:14.41,4:35:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始敏君和凯君就都不在了这种，这不是最恐怖的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:35:23.52,4:35:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,「大概70%在铲雪」
Dialogue: 0,4:35:26.01,4:35:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是虚构的铲雪，所以那么快
Dialogue: 0,4:35:31.13,4:35:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那么一位…
Dialogue: 0,4:35:32.20,4:35:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子…即便不是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,4:35:34.98,4:35:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一般来说也不可能那么顺畅的铲雪呢
Dialogue: 0,4:35:43.19,4:35:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「空气铲雪吗ww」
Dialogue: 0,4:35:44.84,4:35:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以，进展顺利不是吗
Dialogue: 0,4:35:47.70,4:35:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也许…
Dialogue: 0,4:35:51.00,4:35:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「不如说最恐怖的是凯君」
Dialogue: 0,4:35:53.75,4:35:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系，凯君和敏君都不在
Dialogue: 0,4:35:57.09,4:35:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,以为是3个人来的吧那个
Dialogue: 0,4:35:59.29,4:36:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:00.65,4:36:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一直是只有深雪酱我一个的
Dialogue: 0,4:36:05.22,4:36:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，也有这种结局呢，恐怖电影什么的也是
Dialogue: 0,4:36:10.04,4:36:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,主角…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:11.77,4:36:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:36:13.97,4:36:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,其实，最不妙的是主角那种
Dialogue: 0,4:36:20.83,4:36:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「有考究的价值」
Dialogue: 0,4:36:22.28,4:36:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过再怎么说应该还是来了吧…敏君他们
Dialogue: 0,4:36:27.00,4:36:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:28.33,4:36:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不但是不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:36:29.53,4:36:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有证…因为没有什么能证明的啊
Dialogue: 0,4:36:32.86,4:36:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,证明是3个人来的
Dialogue: 0,4:36:34.88,4:36:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,前后的故事也不知道…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:40.04,4:36:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:43.29,4:36:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,主角的幻觉什么的，这类那类
Dialogue: 0,4:36:46.58,4:36:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么的，主角其实本来…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:49.81,4:36:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那边是那个世界什么的
Dialogue: 0,4:36:55.25,4:36:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,或者，凯君也…
Dialogue: 0,4:36:57.18,4:36:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君也是鬼什么的
Dialogue: 0,4:36:59.47,4:37:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，各种各样的可能性都有，考察起来的话
Dialogue: 0,4:37:06.27,4:37:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那个少女，到底是什么呢在巴士站的孩子
Dialogue: 0,4:37:11.34,4:37:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子可能就是那个孩子，我倒也不是完全不觉得…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:15.99,4:37:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,诶也不是吧再怎么说…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:18.04,4:37:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是妈妈吧，那孩子的…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:22.27,4:37:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,说的话是一样的呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:25.93,4:37:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在那个巴士站遇到的女孩最后…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:28.87,4:37:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:37:31.79,4:37:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:33.19,4:37:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,C Part
Dialogue: 0,4:37:40.38,4:37:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来，是这么翠绿的…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:43.04,4:37:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,深山呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:45.33,4:37:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜还没到吗～？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:47.24,4:37:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜快累死了～
Dialogue: 0,4:37:49.90,4:37:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜再一点哦
Dialogue: 0,4:37:51.40,4:37:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜加油
Dialogue: 0,4:37:52.93,4:37:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:52.93,4:37:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:37:54.59,4:37:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜啊，看。这种地方有坟墓
Dialogue: 0,4:37:58.47,4:37:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜真的
Dialogue: 0,4:37:59.63,4:38:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜连供品都有
Dialogue: 0,4:38:02.07,4:38:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}男性｜好了，走吧
Dialogue: 0,4:38:04.33,4:38:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}女性｜诶～等一下～
Dialogue: 0,4:38:11.22,4:38:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,已经
Dialogue: 0,4:38:12.31,4:38:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题了吗…？
Dialogue: 0,4:38:15.56,4:38:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诶…？
Dialogue: 0,4:38:18.54,4:38:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个坟墓没看到呢
Dialogue: 0,4:38:28.38,4:38:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,4:38:31.79,4:38:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是里面的那些
Dialogue: 0,4:38:37.15,4:38:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,4:38:40.45,4:38:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁供奉的呢那些…
Dialogue: 0,4:38:44.34,4:38:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说，是没开的花的那份…？
Dialogue: 0,4:38:52.00,4:38:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，没有那种地方呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:38:54.95,4:38:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,成佛的孩子的坟墓，吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:39:01.59,4:39:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:03.38,4:39:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有不认识的…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:04.72,4:39:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼存在…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:07.02,4:39:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,…吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:39:08.99,4:39:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「深雪酱供奉的吗」
Dialogue: 0,4:39:11.25,4:39:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊也许是那样呢
Dialogue: 0,4:39:14.88,4:39:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪酱，在这件事之后，也许
Dialogue: 0,4:39:19.72,4:39:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,带着花去供奉了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:39:28.79,4:39:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是那样…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:33.31,4:39:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,或者…也有可能是……
Dialogue: 0,4:39:36.05,4:39:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,4:39:38.09,4:39:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「花苞开了吗？」
Dialogue: 0,4:39:39.78,4:39:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢，也许开了呢，那个只有一朵没开的
Dialogue: 0,4:39:47.33,4:39:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,或者…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:49.50,4:39:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪桑的墓什么的
Dialogue: 0,4:39:52.52,4:39:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪桑是…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:54.12,4:39:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，或者说是不是那个呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:39:56.66,4:39:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,敏君凯君的…
Dialogue: 0,4:39:59.10,4:40:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,两人的墓
Dialogue: 0,4:40:01.15,4:40:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也不可能是双人墓吧w
Dialogue: 0,4:40:05.93,4:40:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,深雪亲的…
Dialogue: 0,4:40:07.43,4:40:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大冒险·完
Dialogue: 0,4:40:11.22,4:40:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这就有些耐人寻味了
Dialogue: 0,4:40:13.55,4:40:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的那个是怎么回事呢
Dialogue: 0,4:40:16.08,4:40:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,总之各位
Dialogue: 0,4:40:17.56,4:40:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也感谢您的观看～
Dialogue: 0,4:40:23.60,4:40:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,名为雪葬
Dialogue: 0,4:40:25.08,4:40:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chilla's art桑的最新游戏、新作
Dialogue: 0,4:40:29.01,4:40:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,玩了一下非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,4:40:32.03,4:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地有点铲雪…普通地享受了
Dialogue: 0,4:40:37.56,4:40:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,废品什么的呢
Dialogue: 0,4:40:39.54,4:40:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,更多更多
Dialogue: 0,4:40:41.00,4:40:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，通关后也
Dialogue: 0,4:40:43.22,4:40:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能再升级的话…
Dialogue: 0,4:40:45.72,4:40:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再加上，加上C Part变的更不妙之类
Dialogue: 0,4:40:50.62,4:40:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地，诶诶，享受了一番
Dialogue: 0,4:40:53.43,4:40:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然故事也很有趣
Dialogue: 0,4:40:55.61,4:40:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但靠普通地铲雪超级享受了
Dialogue: 0,4:40:59.01,4:41:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,慢生活呢
Dialogue: 0,4:41:01.97,4:41:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以各位如果也一起开心的话，开心地…
Dialogue: 0,4:41:08.11,4:41:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,享受着
Dialogue: 0,4:41:09.34,4:41:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:41:12.40,4:41:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「全强化了呢」全部强化了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:41:15.51,4:41:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,全部做到最大MAX了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:18.86,4:41:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「幸好有上限」
Dialogue: 0,4:41:21.84,4:41:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「是铲雪模拟器」
Dialogue: 0,4:41:24.02,4:41:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是，已经是了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:25.63,4:41:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很快乐～
Dialogue: 0,4:41:27.93,4:41:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「废品剩了一堆呢」是呀
Dialogue: 0,4:41:30.11,4:41:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有相当多，还在想着…
Dialogue: 0,4:41:31.96,4:41:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是还能收集更多的时候，意外的在很早的阶段
Dialogue: 0,4:41:35.84,4:41:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,升到最大了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:41:39.22,4:41:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,「不知为何变成了很Chill的直播享受了一番」
Dialogue: 0,4:41:42.61,4:41:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:43.51,4:41:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到呢敏君和
Dialogue: 0,4:41:45.74,4:41:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧，两边都，凯也是
Dialogue: 0,4:41:48.34,4:41:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微…
Dialogue: 0,4:41:50.08,4:41:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,说不出口，两边都有点
Dialogue: 0,4:41:53.18,4:41:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坏，与其说坏…
Dialogue: 0,4:41:56.04,4:41:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微疯了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:57.71,4:42:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是村子导致的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:42:00.20,4:42:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还是本性如此，这就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,4:42:03.25,4:42:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是不得了的结局呢
Dialogue: 0,4:42:05.91,4:42:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,4:42:07.11,4:42:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,4:42:08.22,4:42:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有兴趣的人，请一定试试雪葬
Dialogue: 0,4:42:13.20,4:42:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得看和玩的乐趣不一样
Dialogue: 0,4:42:16.96,4:42:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,感兴趣的人请一定请一定
Dialogue: 0,4:42:19.43,4:42:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请玩玩看
Dialogue: 0,4:42:21.11,4:42:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那么各位，今天也感谢您的观看～
Dialogue: 0,4:42:26.19,4:42:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来今天忘记把时钟拿出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:42:31.24,4:42:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是4点前
Dialogue: 0,4:42:33.08,4:42:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样，各位
Dialogue: 0,4:42:36.22,4:42:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也谢谢～
Dialogue: 0,4:42:39.05,4:42:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，之后再会吧～再见～再见～
Dialogue: 0,4:42:44.91,4:42:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦露露啦～
Dialogue: 0,4:42:49.00,4:42:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过能播成真是太好了，一开始真是怕得要死，可能播不了
Dialogue: 0,4:42:56.40,4:42:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷电脑不出问题
Dialogue: 0,4:43:01.00,4:43:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:43:02.92,4:43:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,玩恐怖游戏的前后，好像很容易发生什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:43:08.00,4:43:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的…
Dialogue: 0,4:43:09.02,4:43:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然觉得是偶然
Dialogue: 0,4:43:11.26,4:43:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么偏偏恐怖游戏的时候…
Dialogue: 0,4:43:14.00,4:43:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成那样呢…
Dialogue: 0,4:43:16.22,4:43:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖游戏负载很高？的情况更多吗
Dialogue: 0,4:43:21.96,4:43:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,4:43:24.29,4:43:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，失礼了
Dialogue: 0,4:43:28.91,4:43:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那么各位
Dialogue: 0,4:43:30.86,4:43:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦露露～再见～再见～
Dialogue: 0,4:43:37.11,4:43:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
